(window.webpackJsonp=window.webpackJsonp||[]).push([[75],{1184:function(n){n.exports=JSON.parse('{"html":"<p><strong>event loop它的执行顺序：</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>一开始整个脚本作为一个宏任务执行</li>\\n<li>执行过程中同步代码直接执行，宏任务进入宏任务队列，微任务进入微任务队列</li>\\n<li>当前宏任务执行完出队，检查微任务列表，有则依次执行，直到全部执行完</li>\\n<li>执行浏览器UI线程的渲染工作</li>\\n<li>检查是否有Web Worker任务，有则执行</li>\\n<li>执行完本轮的宏任务，回到2，依此循环，直到宏任务和微任务队列都为空</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>微任务包括</strong>：<code>MutationObserver</code>、<code>Promise.then()</code>或<code>reject()</code>、<code>Promise</code>为基础开发的其它技术，比如<code>fetch API</code>、<code>V8</code>的垃圾回收过程、<code>Node</code>独有的<code>process.nextTick</code>。</p>\\n<p><strong>宏任务包括</strong>：<code>script、script</code> 、<code>setTimeout</code>、<code>setInterval</code> 、<code>setImmediate</code> 、<code>I/O</code> 、<code>UI rendering</code></p>\\n<h2 id=\\"_1-promise的几道基础题\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_1-promise的几道基础题\\">#</a> 1 Promise的几道基础题</h2>\\n<h3 id=\\"_1-1-题目一\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_1-1-题目一\\">#</a> 1.1 题目一</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>new Promise(executor)</code> 会立即调用执行器</li>\\n<li>顺序：<code>promise1</code> → <code>1</code> 与期约对象</li>\\n<li>没调用 <code>resolve</code>、<code>reject</code>，状态保持 <code>pending</code></li>\\n<li>同步抛错也会拒绝，不能只查显式 <code>reject</code></li>\\n<li>控制台展开对象可能展示稍后的状态</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>这段代码先打印 <code>promise1</code>，再打印 <code>1</code> 和一个待定的期约对象。</strong> <code>Promise</code> 构造器里的函数会同步执行，不会因为写在期约里就排到后面。执行器既没调用成功或失败回调，也没抛出异常，所以这个期约一直待定。真正延后执行的是通过 <code>then</code> 等方法注册的回调；创建期约本身仍是普通的同步调用。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>const promise1 = new Promise((resolve, reject) =&gt; {\\n  console.log(&#39;promise1&#39;)\\n})\\nconsole.log(&#39;1&#39;, promise1);\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>从上至下，先遇到new Promise，执行该构造函数中的代码promise1</li>\\n<li>然后执行同步代码1，此时promise1没有被resolve或者reject，因此状态还是pending</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;promise1&#39;\\n&#39;1&#39; Promise{&lt;pending&gt;}\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>执行器里没有定时器，为什么期约还是待定？</strong></p>\\n<p>待定只表示还没有得到成功或失败结果，与有没有异步操作无关。执行器执行结束不会自动完成期约。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>执行器直接 <code>return 123</code>，状态会成功吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，构造器忽略执行器的普通返回值。要通过 <code>resolve(123)</code> 交付结果。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把第一行日志后面换成 <code>throw new Error()</code> 呢？</strong></p>\\n<p>执行器中的同步异常会让期约拒绝。外层构造调用通常返回拒绝的期约，需要通过拒绝处理函数接住。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>控制台展开后看到成功，能证明打印时已经成功吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不一定，开发工具可能延迟读取对象内容。分析顺序时根据代码状态变化判断，必要时记录独立的标量日志。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_1-2-题目二\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_1-2-题目二\\">#</a> 1.2 题目二</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输出：<code>1 → 2 → 4 → 3</code></li>\\n<li><code>resolve(\'success\')</code> 使期约成功，不终止执行器</li>\\n<li><code>then</code> 回调走微任务，当前同步代码先完成</li>\\n<li><code>return resolve(...)</code> 才能顺便退出当前函数</li>\\n<li>区分“状态改变”和“回调执行”的时机</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>输出顺序是 <code>1、2、4、3</code>，因为完成期约不会打断正在执行的同步代码。</strong> 执行器先打印 <code>1</code>，调用 <code>resolve</code> 后继续打印 <code>2</code>；注册的 <code>then</code> 回调不会当场运行，所以外面的 <code>4</code> 先出现。等当前同步任务结束，微任务才打印 <code>3</code>。这里最容易混淆的是期约已经成功，但成功回调仍然要等待执行机会。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'success\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\npromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">4</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>从上至下，先遇到new Promise，执行其中的同步代码1</li>\\n<li>再遇到resolve(\'success\')， 将promise的状态改为了resolved并且将值保存下来</li>\\n<li>继续执行同步代码2</li>\\n<li>跳出promise，往下执行，碰到promise.then这个微任务，将其加入微任务队列</li>\\n<li>执行同步代码4</li>\\n<li>本轮宏任务全部执行完毕，检查微任务队列，发现promise.then这个微任务且状态为resolved，执行它。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>1 2 4 3\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>调用了 <code>resolve</code>，后面的 <code>console.log(2)</code> 为什么还执行？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>resolve</code> 是函数调用，不是控制流程语句。需要停止后续执行时写 <code>return resolve(\'success\')</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>在已经成功的期约上调用 <code>then</code>，能同步得到回调结果吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，回调仍会异步执行。想使用结果，就继续放在回调里，或在异步函数中用 <code>await</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把外面的 <code>4</code> 放到一个零延迟定时器里呢？</strong></p>\\n<p>在普通浏览器执行场景下，成功回调的微任务会先执行，再进入定时器任务。前面的同步 <code>1、2</code> 仍然最先输出。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>resolve</code> 后再调用 <code>reject</code>，会打印哪个回调？</strong></p>\\n<p>第一次有效确定结果后，后续的完成调用不会改变它。这里仍走成功分支，不会因为后来调用 <code>reject</code> 改成失败。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_1-3-题目三\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_1-3-题目三\\">#</a> 1.3 题目三</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输出：<code>1 → 2 → 4</code>，没有 <code>3</code></li>\\n<li>注册成功回调不会主动让期约成功</li>\\n<li>待定时保存反应，完成后才安排对应回调</li>\\n<li>等再久也不会自动从 <code>pending</code> 变成成功</li>\\n<li>超时与取消需要单独设计</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>这里不会打印 <code>3</code>，因为期约一直没有被完成。</strong> 执行器中的两条日志同步输出，外层接着打印 <code>4</code>，但成功回调只是在等待结果。微任务机制不会替业务补出一个结果，也不会因为执行器运行完了就自动调用 <code>then</code>。排查类似的请求一直转圈时，要检查所有分支有没有交付结果，而不是只检查回调是否注册成功。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\npromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">4</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>和题目二相似，只不过在<code>promise</code>中并没有<code>resolve</code>或者<code>reject</code></li>\\n<li>因此<code>promise.then</code>并不会执行，它只有在被改变了状态之后才会执行。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">4</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>等一分钟，成功回调会自己执行吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，期约没有默认超时。必须有某条路径调用完成回调，或者由外部超时逻辑给调用方一个失败结果。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>给它加一个 <code>catch</code>，能结束等待吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，拒绝处理也只是等待拒绝结果。期约既不成功也不失败时，这两个处理分支都不会运行。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想让调用方最多等三秒，可以怎么写？</strong></p>\\n<p>可以把任务与一个定时拒绝的期约交给 <code>Promise.race</code>。这只限制等待结果，不会自动终止底层请求或清理资源。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>执行器某个分支漏了 <code>resolve</code>，怎么避免？</strong></p>\\n<p>把成功、失败和提前退出路径逐一列清楚，确保需要返回结果的路径都有完成动作。能直接返回已有异步接口时，就不要再手动包一层构造器。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_1-4-题目四\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_1-4-题目四\\">#</a> 1.4 题目四</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>同步输出：<code>promise1</code>，再打印两个期约</li>\\n<li><code>promise1</code> 已成功，值为 <code>resolve1</code></li>\\n<li><code>promise2</code> 此时待定，等待 <code>then</code> 回调执行</li>\\n<li>随后打印 <code>resolve1</code>，<code>promise2</code> 成功为 <code>undefined</code></li>\\n<li><code>then</code> 返回新期约，不是返回原来的对象</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>第二个期约要等成功回调执行结束，才能确定自己的结果。</strong> 第一个期约在执行器里已经成功，所以同步打印它时逻辑状态是成功；调用 <code>then</code> 得到的第二个期约此时还在等待。同步日志完成后，回调打印 <code>resolve1</code>，又因为没有显式返回值，第二个期约最终以 <code>undefined</code> 成功。控制台对象展示可能延后，判断状态要按这条执行链来推。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise1 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'resolve1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise2 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> promise1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> promise1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> promise2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>从上至下，先遇到<code>new Promise</code>，执行该构造函数中的代码<code>promise1</code></li>\\n<li>碰到<code>resolve</code>函数, 将<code>promise1</code>的状态改变为<code>resolved</code>, 并将结果保存下来</li>\\n<li>碰到<code>promise1.then</code>这个微任务，将它放入微任务队列</li>\\n<li><code>promise2</code>是一个新的状态为<code>pending的</code>Promise`</li>\\n<li>执行同步代码1， 同时打印出<code>promise1</code>的状态是<code>resolved</code></li>\\n<li>执行同步代码2，同时打印出<code>promise2</code>的状态是<code>pending</code></li>\\n<li>宏任务执行完毕，查找微任务队列，发现<code>promise1.then</code>这个微任务且状态为resolved，执行它。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;promise1&#39;\\n&#39;1&#39; Promise{&lt;resolved&gt;: &#39;resolve1&#39;}\\n&#39;2&#39; Promise{&lt;pending&gt;}\\n&#39;resolve1&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>promise1 === promise2</code> 会得到什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>是 <code>false</code>，<code>then</code> 创建并返回一个新期约。这个新对象负责承接回调的返回值或异常。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>回调写成 <code>return res + \'!\'</code>，第二个期约是什么结果？</strong></p>\\n<p>它会以 <code>resolve1!</code> 成功。回调正常返回什么，新期约就接收什么；返回期约或可兑现对象时还会采用对应结果。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>第一个期约成功，第二个就一定成功吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不一定，成功回调也可能抛错或返回拒绝的期约。后续状态取决于回调执行结果。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>不传成功回调，写 <code>promise1.then()</code> 会怎样？</strong></p>\\n<p>成功值会继续传递给新的期约。返回对象仍然是新的，不能用对象相等判断是否传递了结果。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_1-5-题目五\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_1-5-题目五\\">#</a> 1.5 题目五</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输出：<code>1 → start → success</code></li>\\n<li>定义 <code>fn</code> 不执行，调用 <code>fn()</code> 才进入构造器</li>\\n<li>执行器同步打印 <code>1</code> 并完成期约</li>\\n<li>成功回调进入微任务，晚于外层同步日志</li>\\n<li>区分函数调用与回调注册，别见期约就全部后移</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><code>fn()</code> 是同步调用，所以它里面的 <code>1</code> 会先于外层的 <code>start</code>。</strong> 调用过程中创建期约，执行器立即运行并交付 <code>success</code>；随后注册成功回调，当前同步流程继续打印 <code>start</code>。等同步代码完成，回调才打印成功值。做这类顺序题时，把“调用一个返回期约的函数”和“等待期约回调”分开，执行顺序就很清楚。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">fn</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'success\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">fn</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>请仔细看看哦，fn函数它是直接返回了一个new Promise的，而且fn函数的调用是在start之前，所以它里面的内容应该会先执行。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>1\\n&#39;start&#39;\\n&#39;success&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>只保留函数定义，不调用它，还会打印 <code>1</code> 吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，函数体没有执行。定义函数与创建函数体里的期约是两件事。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>连续调用 <code>fn()</code> 两次，会共用一个期约吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>这里不会，每次调用都会执行 <code>new Promise</code> 并打印一次 <code>1</code>。需要共享结果时，要显式保存并复用返回对象。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把 <code>console.log(\'start\')</code> 移到调用前面呢？</strong></p>\\n<p>顺序变成 <code>start、1、success</code>。前两条仍是按代码顺序执行的同步日志，成功回调依旧在后面。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把执行器里的计算写得很重，会阻塞 <code>start</code> 吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>会，期约构造器不会把同步计算搬到其他线程。重计算需要分片、工作线程或其他合适的处理方式。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_1-6-题目六\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_1-6-题目六\\">#</a> 1.6 题目六</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输出：<code>start → 1 → success</code></li>\\n<li>先执行外层日志，再调用 <code>fn()</code></li>\\n<li>创建期约时，执行器仍然同步运行</li>\\n<li>成功回调在当前同步流程结束后运行</li>\\n<li>顺序取决于调用位置，不取决于函数定义位置</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>把调用放到 <code>start</code> 后面，输出就变成 <code>start、1、success</code>。</strong> 函数提前定义并不意味着函数体提前执行，真正进入执行器要等到 <code>fn()</code> 被调用。调用时同步打印 <code>1</code> 并完成期约，然后登记的成功回调等待微任务执行。这里没有多个线程争抢日志，只要按同步调用链走完，再处理已经可以运行的回调，就不会把顺序算反。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>如果把fn的调用放到start之后呢？</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">fn</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"success\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"start\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">fn</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>现在start就在1之前打印出来了，因为fn函数是之后执行的。</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>注意⚠️：之前我们很容易就以为看到<code>new Promise()</code>就执行它的第一个参数函数了，其实这是不对的，就像这两道题中，我们得注意它是不是被包裹在函数当中，如果是的话，只有在函数调用的时候才会执行。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&quot;start&quot;\\n1\\n&quot;success&quot;\\n</code></pre>\\n<h2 id=\\"_2-promise结合settimeout\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-promise结合settimeout\\">#</a> 2. Promise结合setTimeout</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>函数定义写在文件最顶部，为什么 <code>1</code> 还是后打印？</strong></p>\\n<p>定义只是创建函数，调用才执行函数体。日志位置要沿实际调用顺序判断。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>在 <code>fn()</code> 后再加一条同步日志，会排在哪里？</strong></p>\\n<p>排在 <code>1</code> 后、<code>success</code> 前。成功回调不会插入尚未结束的同步调用流程。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把 <code>fn</code> 改成异步函数，里面的首条日志会延后吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，异步函数从调用开始同步运行到第一个挂起点。<code>async</code> 本身不会让函数开头整段代码自动延迟。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想在拿到 <code>success</code> 后再打印完成，怎么保证？</strong></p>\\n<p>放进同一个成功回调，或写 <code>const value = await fn()</code> 后再打印。不要通过猜测定时器延迟来等待结果。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-1-题目一\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-1-题目一\\">#</a> 2.1 题目一</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输出：<code>start → end → resolve → time</code></li>\\n<li>零延迟定时器也不会打断同步代码</li>\\n<li>成功回调是微任务，先于后续定时器任务</li>\\n<li>延迟参数表示调度门槛，不保证精确执行时间</li>\\n<li>微任务持续追加可能推迟定时器和渲染</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>同步代码先跑完，接着处理微任务，所以成功回调会在定时器前面打印。</strong> <code>setTimeout</code> 即使省略延迟，也只是安排一个后续任务，不会立刻执行回调。<code>Promise.resolve().then(...)</code> 注册的回调则在当前同步任务结束后的微任务检查点执行。于是先看到 <code>start</code> 和 <code>end</code>，再看到 <code>resolve</code>，最后才是 <code>time</code>；这里比较的是任务类型，不是调用代码谁写在前面。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code>console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'time\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nPromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'resolve\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'end\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>刚开始整个脚本作为一个宏任务来执行，对于同步代码直接压入执行栈进行执行，因此先打印出start和end。</li>\\n<li>setTimout作为一个宏任务被放入宏任务队列(下一个)</li>\\n<li>Promise.then作为一个微任务被放入微任务队列</li>\\n<li>本次宏任务执行完，检查微任务，发现Promise.then，执行它</li>\\n<li>接下来进入下一个宏任务，发现setTimeout，执行。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;start&#39;\\n&#39;end&#39;\\n&#39;resolve&#39;\\n&#39;time&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>定时器明明先注册，为什么还排在后面？</strong></p>\\n<p>它和期约回调不在同一类队列里。当前任务结束后先清空可执行微任务，再有机会运行后面的定时器任务。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把定时器延迟写成 <code>0</code>，结果会改变吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>在这个场景下不会。零延迟不代表同步执行，也不能越过当前任务和待执行的微任务。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>成功回调里再注册一个成功回调，会等到定时器之后吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，新增微任务通常继续在这次检查点被处理。不断追加微任务可能让定时器迟迟得不到执行机会。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>同步循环跑了两秒，定时器能在中途执行吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，同一主线程上运行的同步代码不会被定时器回调抢占。定时器达到时间条件后仍要等待执行机会。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-2-题目二\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-2-题目二\\">#</a> 2.2 题目二</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>先输出：<code>1 → 2 → 4</code></li>\\n<li>定时器任务：<code>timerStart → timerEnd</code></li>\\n<li><code>resolve</code> 安排反应，不插队打断定时器函数</li>\\n<li>定时器结束后，微任务输出 <code>success</code></li>\\n<li>注册回调与回调入队，不一定发生在同一时刻</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>完整顺序是 <code>1、2、4、timerStart、timerEnd、success</code>。</strong> 执行器同步运行，定时器先被安排到后续，所以 <code>1、2、4</code> 先出现。等定时器运行，调用 <code>resolve</code> 才让已注册的成功回调具备执行条件，但定时器剩下的同步代码仍会继续，先打印 <code>timerEnd</code>。这次任务结束后进入微任务检查点，才打印成功值。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"timerStart\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"success\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"timerEnd\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\npromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">4</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>和题目1.2很像，不过在resolve的外层加了一层setTimeout定时器。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li>从上至下，先遇到new Promise，执行该构造函数中的代码1</li>\\n<li>然后碰到了定时器，将这个定时器中的函数放到下一个宏任务的延迟队列中等待执行\\n执行同步代码2</li>\\n<li>跳出promise函数，遇到promise.then，但其状态还是为pending，这里理解为先不执行\\n执行同步代码4</li>\\n<li>一轮循环过后，进入第二次宏任务，发现延迟队列中有setTimeout定时器，执行它</li>\\n<li>首先执行timerStart，然后遇到了resolve，将promise的状态改为resolved且保存结果并将之前的promise.then推入微任务队列</li>\\n<li>继续执行同步代码timerEnd</li>\\n<li>宏任务全部执行完毕，查找微任务队列，发现promise.then这个微任务，执行它</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>1\\n2\\n4\\n&quot;timerStart&quot;\\n&quot;timerEnd&quot;\\n&quot;success&quot;\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>调用 <code>then</code> 时，成功回调已经进入可执行队列了吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>此时期约还是待定，只是保存了反应。等定时器调用 <code>resolve</code>，对应反应才会被安排执行。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>resolve</code> 后面抛错，会让这个期约变失败吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，结果已经确定；而且定时器回调里的异常也不属于构造器同步捕获范围。要在异步回调里显式处理异常。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把 <code>timerEnd</code> 放进另一个成功回调，会怎样？</strong></p>\\n<p>要按两个微任务的实际入队顺序判断。<code>resolve</code> 先安排已有反应，再注册到已成功期约上的回调，通常会排在后面。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>定时器里先打印结果再 <code>resolve</code>，和在 <code>then</code> 里打印一样吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>最终文字可能一样，执行时机不同。前者仍在定时器同步回调里，后者会等待微任务执行机会。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-3-题目三\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-3-题目三\\">#</a> 2.3 题目三</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>嵌套定时器：<code>start → timer1 → timer2 → timer3</code></li>\\n<li>内层换成微任务：<code>start → timer1 → promise → timer2</code></li>\\n<li>一个任务结束就可能进入微任务检查点</li>\\n<li>嵌套定时器需要等待新的任务执行机会</li>\\n<li>不把同类定时器示例推广成所有任务源统一先进先出</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>区别在于第一个定时器结束后，是先处理微任务，还是等待下一个定时器任务。</strong> 内层仍是定时器时，它在第一个回调运行期间才被注册，通常排在已经等待的第二个定时器后面；换成成功期约回调后，就会在第一个定时器结束后的微任务检查点运行，所以插到第二个定时器之前。分析时要以每个任务为边界，不能把所有异步回调混成一条队列。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>题目三分了两个题目，因为看着都差不多，不过执行的结果却不一样，大家不妨先猜猜下面两个题目分别执行什么：</p>\\n<ol>\\n<li></li>\\n</ol>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer3\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;start&#39;\\n&#39;timer1&#39;\\n&#39;timer2&#39;\\n&#39;timer3&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<ol start=\\"2\\">\\n<li></li>\\n</ol>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;start&#39;\\n&#39;timer1&#39;\\n&#39;promise&#39;\\n&#39;timer2&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>这两个例子，看着好像只是把第一个定时器中的内容换了一下而已。</li>\\n<li>一个是为定时器timer3，一个是为Promise.then</li>\\n<li>但是如果是定时器timer3的话，它会在timer2后执行，而Promise.then却是在timer2之前执行。</li>\\n<li>你可以这样理解，Promise.then是微任务，它会被加入到本轮中的微任务列表，而定时器timer3是宏任务，它会被加入到下一轮的宏任务中。</li>\\n<li>理解完这两个案例，可以来看看下面一道比较难的题目了</li>\\n</ul>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>为什么内层定时器不能接着 <code>timer1</code> 立即执行？</strong></p>\\n<p>注册定时器只是安排未来任务，当前回调不会直接调用它。它还要等待计时条件和任务调度。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>第二个定时器已经到时间了，微任务还能先跑吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>可以，达到时间条件不等于马上执行。当前任务结束后的微任务检查点仍会先处理已经排好的期约反应。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>内层微任务再创建一个定时器，会排在微任务前吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，新定时器需要后续任务机会。微任务自己的同步代码会先执行完。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>网络回调和定时器也能一律按注册顺序排列吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，不同任务来源有各自的就绪与调度条件。这个例子能说明微任务检查点，不能推出所有异步事件都有统一注册顺序。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-4-题目三\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-4-题目三\\">#</a> 2.4 题目三</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输出：<code>start → promise1 → timer1 → promise2 → timer2</code></li>\\n<li>同步阶段注册 <code>timer1</code>，先打印 <code>start</code></li>\\n<li>首个微任务打印 <code>promise1</code>，此时才注册 <code>timer2</code></li>\\n<li><code>timer1</code> 完成后先跑新微任务，再轮到 <code>timer2</code></li>\\n<li>看真实注册时刻，别只看源码位置</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>顺序是 <code>start、promise1、timer1、promise2、timer2</code>，关键是第二个定时器注册得更晚。</strong> 虽然包含它的代码写在前面，但那段成功回调要等同步任务结束才运行，此时第一个定时器早已注册。接下来第一个定时器打印日志，并添加新的微任务；这个微任务在下一个定时器任务前执行。推导时每跑完一个任务，就把它产生的微任务处理完。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code>Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> timer2 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> timer1 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>这道题稍微的难一些，在promise中执行定时器，又在定时器中执行promise；</li>\\n<li>并且要注意的是，这里的Promise是直接resolve的，而之前的new Promise不一样。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>因此过程分析为</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>刚开始整个脚本作为第一次宏任务来执行，我们将它标记为宏1，从上至下执行</li>\\n<li>遇到Promise.resolve().then这个微任务，将then中的内容加入第一次的微任务队列标记为微1</li>\\n<li>遇到定时器timer1，将它加入下一次宏任务的延迟列表，标记为宏2，等待执行(先不管里面是什么内容)</li>\\n<li>执行宏1中的同步代码start</li>\\n<li>第一次宏任务(宏1)执行完毕，检查第一次的微任务队列(微1)，发现有一个promise.then这个微任务需要执行</li>\\n<li>执行打印出微1中同步代码promise1，然后发现定时器timer2，将它加入宏2的后面，标记为宏3</li>\\n<li>第一次微任务队列(微1)执行完毕，执行第二次宏任务(宏2)，首先执行同步代码timer1</li>\\n<li>然后遇到了promise2这个微任务，将它加入此次循环的微任务队列，标记为微2</li>\\n<li>宏2中没有同步代码可执行了，查找本次循环的微任务队列(微2)，发现了promise2，执行它</li>\\n<li>第二轮执行完毕，执行宏3，打印出timer2</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;start&#39;\\n&#39;promise1&#39;\\n&#39;timer1&#39;\\n&#39;promise2&#39;\\n&#39;timer2&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><img src=\\"https://s.poetries.top/gitee/2020/03/2.png\\" alt=\\"\\"></p>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>timer2</code> 的代码写得更靠前，为什么反而晚？</strong></p>\\n<p>写在函数体里不等于已经执行。只有第一个成功回调真正运行时，内层的 <code>setTimeout</code> 才被调用。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把 <code>timer2</code> 移到成功回调外面，顺序会变吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>会影响两个同延迟定时器的注册顺序。要按移动后的实际调用位置重新推导，不能保留之前的编号结论。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>timer1</code> 里再连着注册两个微任务，会在哪里执行？</strong></p>\\n<p>它们都在这个定时器任务结束后的微任务检查点执行。普通顺序注册的独立微任务按入队顺序运行，再进入后续任务。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>promise1</code> 做了很久的同步计算，会让两个定时器等待吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>会，同一线程上的定时器无法抢占正在运行的回调。微任务里的重计算同样会阻塞交互和后续任务。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-5-题目四\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-5-题目四\\">#</a> 2.5 题目四</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>首次同步打印：两个期约都为 <code>pending</code></li>\\n<li>首个定时器让 <code>promise1</code> 以 <code>success</code> 成功</li>\\n<li>成功回调抛错，拒绝的是新期约 <code>promise2</code></li>\\n<li>后续观察：一个 <code>fulfilled</code>，一个 <code>rejected</code></li>\\n<li>未处理拒绝如何显示，由运行环境决定</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>第一个期约成功以后，第二个仍然可以因为回调抛错而失败。</strong> 同步打印时定时器还没执行，两个对象都处于待定状态；约一秒后，第一个得到成功值，随后运行的成功回调抛出异常，让链上新建的第二个期约拒绝。因此后面的观察能看到不同状态。这里不是第一个期约从成功变失败，而是两个不同对象分别接收了不同结果。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise1 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'success\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise2 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> promise1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'error!!!\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> promise1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> promise2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> promise1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> promise2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>从上至下，先执行第一个new Promise中的函数，碰到setTimeout将它加入下一个宏任务列表</li>\\n<li>跳出new Promise，碰到promise1.then这个微任务，但其状态还是为pending，这里理解为先不执行</li>\\n<li>promise2是一个新的状态为pending的Promise</li>\\n<li>执行同步代码console.log(\'promise1\')，且打印出的promise1的状态为pending</li>\\n<li>执行同步代码console.log(\'promise2\')，且打印出的promise2的状态为pending</li>\\n<li>碰到第二个定时器，将其放入下一个宏任务列表</li>\\n<li>第一轮宏任务执行结束，并且没有微任务需要执行，因此执行第二轮宏任务</li>\\n<li>先执行第一个定时器里的内容，将promise1的状态改为resolved且保存结果并将之前的promise1.then推入微任务队列</li>\\n<li>该定时器中没有其它的同步代码可执行，因此执行本轮的微任务队列，也就是promise1.then，它抛出了一个错误，且将promise2的状态设置为了rejected</li>\\n<li>第一个定时器执行完毕，开始执行第二个定时器中的内容</li>\\n<li>打印出\'promise1\'，且此时promise1的状态为resolved</li>\\n<li>打印出\'promise2\'，且此时promise2的状态为rejected</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span>pending<span class=\\"token operator\\">></span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise2\'</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span>pending<span class=\\"token operator\\">></span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\ntest5<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>html<span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span><span class=\\"token number\\">102</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">Uncaught</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">in</span> promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> Error<span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> error<span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span> at test<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>html<span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span><span class=\\"token number\\">102</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span>resolved<span class=\\"token operator\\">></span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token string\\">\\"success\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise2\'</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span>rejected<span class=\\"token operator\\">></span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> Error<span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> error<span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>成功回调抛错，会把第一个期约改成失败吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，第一个结果已经确定。异常会成为这次 <code>then</code> 返回的新期约的拒绝原因。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>给 <code>promise1</code> 加 <code>catch</code>，能接住 <code>promise2</code> 的错误吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，两个处理分支不同。要在 <code>promise2</code> 上接拒绝处理，或者继续连接产生错误的那条链。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>两秒后的日志一定精确在两秒时出现吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不保证，主线程忙碌和调度都会延迟回调。这个时间是等待条件，不是实时执行承诺。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>控制台的未处理错误位置能当成固定输出顺序背吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不适合，环境对未处理拒绝的报告方式不同。应先推导期约状态和代码日志，再单独说明缺少拒绝处理。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_2-6-题目五\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_2-6-题目五\\">#</a> 2.6 题目五</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>执行器日志最先出现，初始两个期约都待定</li>\\n<li>定时器中先 <code>resolve</code>，仍继续打印 <code>timer1</code></li>\\n<li>微任务里抛错，使 <code>promise2</code> 拒绝</li>\\n<li><code>timer2</code> 观察到第一个成功、第二个失败</li>\\n<li>异步错误沿对应链传递，不会跨分支自动捕获</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><code>timer1</code> 会先于成功回调里的异常发生，因为 <code>resolve</code> 不会打断定时器的同步执行。</strong> 一开始先打印执行器里的文字和两个待定对象；第一个定时器完成第一个期约后，继续打印自己的日志。然后成功回调作为微任务运行并抛错，第二个期约才变成拒绝。后面的定时器看到的是这两个最终结果，未处理拒绝还可能被环境单独报告。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>如果你上面这道题搞懂了之后，我们就可以来做做这道了，你应该能很快就给出答案：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise1 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"success\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"timer1\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"promise1里的内容\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise2 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> promise1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"error!!!\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"promise1\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> promise1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"promise2\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> promise2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"timer2\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"promise1\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> promise1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"promise2\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> promise2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1里的内容\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span>pending<span class=\\"token operator\\">></span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise2\'</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span>pending<span class=\\"token operator\\">></span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer1\'</span>\\ntest5<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>html<span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span><span class=\\"token number\\">102</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">Uncaught</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">in</span> promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> Error<span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> error<span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span> at test<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>html<span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span><span class=\\"token number\\">102</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer2\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span>resolved<span class=\\"token operator\\">></span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token string\\">\\"success\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise2\'</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span>rejected<span class=\\"token operator\\">></span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> Error<span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> error<span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<h2 id=\\"_3-promise中的then、catch、finally\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-promise中的then、catch、finally\\">#</a> 3. Promise中的then、catch、finally</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Promise的状态一经改变就不能再改变</li>\\n<li>.then和.catch都会返回一个新的Promise</li>\\n<li><code>catch</code> 只能处理传递到它所在链路的拒绝；其他分支、已经恢复的错误，以及无关联的异步回调异常，不会自动被它捕获</li>\\n<li>在Promise中，返回任意一个非 promise 的值都会被包裹成 promise 对象，例如return 2会被包装为return Promise.resolve(2)</li>\\n<li>Promise 的 .then 或者 .catch 可以被调用多次, 当如果Promise内部的状态一经改变，并且有了一个值，那么后续每次调用.then或者.catch的时候都会直接拿到该值</li>\\n<li>.then 或者 .catch 中 return 一个 error 对象并不会抛出错误，所以不会被后续的 .catch 捕获</li>\\n<li>回调不能返回由这次 <code>then</code> 或 <code>catch</code> 创建的同一个期约，否则该期约会以 <code>TypeError</code> 拒绝；返回先前已有的期约并不等于这种自引用</li>\\n<li>.then 或者 .catch 的参数期望是函数，传入非函数则会发生值穿透</li>\\n<li>.then方法是能接收两个参数的，第一个是处理成功的函数，第二个是处理失败的函数，再某些时候你可以认为catch是.then第二个参数的简便写法</li>\\n<li>.finally方法也是返回一个Promise，他在Promise结束的时候，无论结果为resolved还是rejected，都会执行里面的回调函数</li>\\n</ul>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想在第二个期约失败时显示提示，处理器接哪里？</strong></p>\\n<p>接在 <code>promise2.catch(...)</code>，让它处理对应链上的异常。给已经成功的 <code>promise1</code> 增加错误回调没有用。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把 <code>timer1</code> 日志放到 <code>resolve</code> 前，成功回调会提前吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，它仍要等当前定时器回调结束。这个改动只改变定时器内部同步语句顺序。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>给 <code>promise2</code> 加 <code>catch</code> 后，原对象变成功了吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>没有，<code>promise2</code> 仍是拒绝。正常返回的拒绝处理会让 <code>catch</code> 返回的新期约成功。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>定时器回调直接抛错，外面的期约会自动拒绝吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会自动捕获跨异步边界的异常。需要在定时器内部捕获后调用 <code>reject</code>，或使用已经正确封装的异步接口。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-1-题目一\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-1-题目一\\">#</a> 3.1 题目一</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>首次完成调用：<code>resolve(\'success1\')</code></li>\\n<li>后续 <code>reject</code> 与再次 <code>resolve</code> 不覆盖结果</li>\\n<li>成功回调输出 <code>then: success1</code></li>\\n<li>忽略完成调用，不代表忽略后续普通代码</li>\\n<li>采用待定期约时，锁定结果与立即兑现有区别</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>最终打印 <code>then: success1</code>，因为第一次有效完成调用已经确定了结果。</strong> 后面的拒绝和第二次成功调用都无法覆盖它，错误分支自然不会运行。不过执行器并没有因此退出，后续普通语句仍然会执行。还要区分直接交付普通值与采用另一个期约：后者可能仍在等待，但也不会再接受后续完成调用来改换结果来源。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"success1\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"error\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"success2\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\npromise\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"then: \\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"catch: \\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&quot;then: success1&quot;\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>构造函数中的 resolve 或 reject 只有第一次执行有效，多次调用没有任何作用 。验证了第一个结论，Promise的状态一经改变就不能再改变</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>第一次 <code>resolve</code> 后面还有发请求，会执行吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>会，完成期约不等于退出函数。要避免后续动作，需要显式 <code>return</code> 或调整分支结构。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>先 <code>reject</code> 再 <code>resolve</code>，会以成功结束吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，第一次拒绝已经有效。后续成功调用不能恢复同一个期约，只能通过链上的拒绝处理产生新的成功期约。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>先采用一个还没完成的期约，再 <code>reject</code> 呢？</strong></p>\\n<p>后面的拒绝也会被忽略。结果已经锁定为跟随前一个期约，只是最终兑现或拒绝还没发生。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>这种只生效一次的规则，能阻止重复网络请求吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，它只限制期约结果。请求是否重复发出还要靠调用控制、共享任务或业务去重。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-2-题目二\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-2-题目二\\">#</a> 3.2 题目二</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>开头拒绝，两个成功处理函数都跳过</li>\\n<li><code>catch</code> 打印 <code>error</code>，正常返回 <code>undefined</code></li>\\n<li>后面的新期约恢复成功，最后打印 <code>then: undefined</code></li>\\n<li>恢复的是后续链，不是修改最初拒绝对象</li>\\n<li>要继续失败就抛出错误或返回拒绝期约</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>错误处理正常结束以后，后面的链会走成功分支。</strong> 最初的拒绝穿过两个没有拒绝处理函数的 <code>then</code>，到 <code>catch</code> 才被接住。这个回调只打印日志，没有抛错也没有显式返回，因此它返回的新期约以 <code>undefined</code> 成功，最后的 <code>then</code> 仍然执行。实际业务里，如果只是记日志、不想吞掉失败，就要把错误继续抛出。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"error\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"success2\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\npromise\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"then: \\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"then: \\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"catch: \\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"then: \\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\n</code></pre>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&quot;catch: &quot; &quot;error&quot;\\n&quot;then: &quot; undefined\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>拒绝会沿着没有拒绝处理函数的链继续传递；这里的 <code>catch</code> 正常返回后，新期约以 <code>undefined</code> 成功。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>只在 <code>catch</code> 打日志，调用方会认为请求成功了吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>如果把处理后的期约返回给调用方，它会看到成功的 <code>undefined</code>。记录后写 <code>throw err</code>，才能继续保留失败语义。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想失败时使用缓存数据，怎么接这条链？</strong></p>\\n<p>在 <code>catch</code> 中返回缓存值，例如 <code>return cachedData</code>。后续成功回调就能统一处理网络结果或缓存结果。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>最初那个拒绝对象会因为后面的恢复变成功吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，状态确定后不能改变。恢复只影响拒绝处理返回的新期约。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>错误处理自己又抛错，后面的成功回调还会执行吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，新的拒绝继续向后传递。需要后续另一个拒绝处理函数接住它。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-3-题目三\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-3-题目三\\">#</a> 3.3 题目三</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输出：<code>1 → 2</code></li>\\n<li>第一个成功回调 <code>return 2</code></li>\\n<li>没有拒绝，<code>catch</code> 的回调不执行</li>\\n<li>成功值穿过缺少成功处理器的阶段继续传递</li>\\n<li>每次 <code>then</code>、<code>catch</code> 都返回新期约</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>最后拿到的是 <code>2</code>，因为链上的值来自上一个实际执行回调的返回值。</strong> 第一个成功回调打印 <code>1</code>，再返回普通值 <code>2</code>，于是后续期约成功。中间的 <code>catch</code> 只处理拒绝，这次不会运行，它也不会把成功值清空，所以最后的成功回调仍然拿到 <code>2</code>。这种返回值传递让多步转换可以顺着一条链写，而不必在外面维护临时变量。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code>Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>1\\n2\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Promise可以链式调用，不过promise 每次调用 .then 或者 .catch 都会返回一个新的 promise，从而实现了链式调用, 它并不像一般我们任务的链式调用一样return this</li>\\n<li>上面的输出结果之所以依次打印出1和2，那是因为resolve(1)之后走的是第一个then方法，并没有走catch里，所以第二个then中的res得到的实际上是第一个then的返回值</li>\\n<li>且return 2会被包装成resolve(2)</li>\\n</ul>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把 <code>return 2</code> 删除，最后输出什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>输出 <code>undefined</code>。回调执行了但没有返回值，与没有成功处理函数而发生值传递不同。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>catch</code> 没执行，为什么链还能往下走？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>catch</code> 不会截断成功结果。没有需要处理的拒绝时，成功值继续传给它返回的新期约。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>返回另一个请求的期约，下一步拿到对象还是数据？</strong></p>\\n<p>会等待这个期约的结果，成功时拿到数据，失败时沿拒绝链传播。通常不需要再嵌套一层成功回调。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>then</code> 返回自身，为什么不能像普通链式工具那样设计？</strong></p>\\n<p>每个阶段可能产生不同值或错误，需要独立结果对象。返回新期约才能同时支持结果转换和多个分支。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-4-题目四\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-4-题目四\\">#</a> 3.4 题目四</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输出：<code>1 → 3</code></li>\\n<li>初始拒绝跳过第一个成功回调</li>\\n<li><code>catch</code> 接收原因 <code>1</code>，返回备用值 <code>3</code></li>\\n<li>正常返回让后续链成功</li>\\n<li>错误对象、错误状态与业务失败要区分</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>这次先输出拒绝原因 <code>1</code>，再输出错误处理返回的备用值 <code>3</code>。</strong> 开头已经拒绝，所以第一个成功回调不执行；<code>catch</code> 接住错误后正常返回一个数字，使后面的新期约成功。最后的 <code>then</code> 处理的就是这个数字。这个模式适合真正可以恢复的失败，例如改用默认配置，但不能把所有异常都变成默认值，否则调用方会失去失败信息。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>如果把3.3中的Promise.resolve(1)改为Promise.reject(1)又会怎么样呢？</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code>Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">3</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>1\\n3\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>结果打印的当然是 1 和 3啦，因为reject(1)此时走的就是catch，且第二个then中的res得到的就是catch中的返回值</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>备用值是异步读取的缓存，能直接返回期约吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>可以，后续链会等待它。如果读取缓存也失败，拒绝会继续传下去。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>返回 <code>null</code>，是不是还算失败？</strong></p>\\n<p>从期约状态看是成功，成功值是 <code>null</code>。业务是否把它当成无数据，需要接口约定，不能与拒绝混为一谈。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想记录错误但不提供备用值，该怎么写？</strong></p>\\n<p>记录后重新抛出，例如 <code>catch(err =&gt; { report(err); throw err })</code>。这样调用方还能决定如何处理失败。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>前面的成功回调没执行，它里面的 <code>return 2</code> 有作用吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>没有，函数体没有运行，返回语句也不会参与结果。沿实际执行分支追踪值即可。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-5-题目五\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-5-题目五\\">#</a> 3.5 题目五</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>一个任务，可以挂多个独立成功回调</li>\\n<li>执行器与内部定时器只创建一次</li>\\n<li>顺序：<code>timer</code> → 第一条成功日志 → 第二条成功日志</li>\\n<li>两个回调接收同一成功值</li>\\n<li>耗时是测量结果，不承诺固定 <code>1001ms</code>、<code>1002ms</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>注册两个成功回调不会让同一个异步任务执行两次。</strong> 期约在创建时已经安排了一个定时器，两个 <code>then</code> 只是分别订阅结果。定时器打印 <code>timer</code> 并完成期约后，两个回调都会拿到 <code>success</code>，通常按注册顺序运行。打印的耗时可能相同也可能不同，取决于实际调度与计时精度，不能把示例里的毫秒数当成规范保证。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'success\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> start <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Date<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">now</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\npromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> Date<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">now</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> start<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\npromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> Date<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">now</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">-</span> start<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;timer&#39;\\nsuccess 1001\\nsuccess 1002\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>当然，如果你足够快的话，也可能两个都是1001。\\nPromise 的 .then 或者 .catch 可以被调用多次，但这里 Promise 构造函数只执行一次。或者说 promise 内部状态一经改变，并且有了一个值，那么后续每次调用 .then 或者 .catch 都会直接拿到该值</p>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>给请求期约挂三个 <code>then</code>，会发送三次请求吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，订阅现有期约不会重新创建请求。重复调用创建请求的函数，才可能发起新的网络操作。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>第一个成功回调返回 <code>2</code>，第二个也会收到 <code>2</code> 吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>这里不会，两个回调都直接挂在同一个原始期约上。第一个返回的值只影响它自己产生的后续链。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>第一个回调抛错，会阻止第二个回调吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，它们是独立反应。错误会拒绝第一个 <code>then</code> 返回的期约，那个分支仍要单独处理。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>任务已经成功以后再订阅，还能得到结果吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>能，期约会保留结果。但新注册的回调仍然异步运行，不会变成同步调用。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-6-题目六\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-6-题目六\\">#</a> 3.6 题目六</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>return new Error()</code> 是正常返回对象</li>\\n<li>后续走 <code>then</code>，拿到错误对象本身</li>\\n<li><code>throw</code> 才把异常交给拒绝链</li>\\n<li>返回 <code>Promise.reject(...)</code> 也会导致拒绝</li>\\n<li>判断失败要看约定与状态，不看值长得像不像错误</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>返回错误对象和抛出错误，是两种完全不同的行为。</strong> <code>Error</code> 也只是一个对象，成功回调正常返回它时，下一步仍会进入成功分支，只是拿到的值是这个对象。要让链转为拒绝，可以直接 <code>throw</code>，或者返回拒绝的期约。做接口封装时也要统一错误约定，否则一层返回错误值、另一层只用 <code>catch</code>，就可能把失败当成成功。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code>Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'error!!!\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"then: \\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"catch: \\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>你可能想到的是进入.catch然后被捕获了错误。</li>\\n<li>结果并不是这样的，它走的是.then里面：</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&quot;then: &quot; &quot;Error: error!!!&quot;\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>这也验证了第4点和第6点，返回任意一个非 promise 的值都会被包裹成 promise 对象，因此这里的return new Error(\'error!!!\')也被包裹成了return Promise.resolve(new Error(\'error!!!\'))</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p>当然如果你抛出一个错误的话，可以用下面👇两的任意一种：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'error!!!\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// or</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'error!!!\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>return new Error(\'失败\')</code> 后，<code>catch</code> 为什么没执行？</strong></p>\\n<p>因为没有抛异常，期约以这个对象成功。把返回改成 <code>throw new Error(\'失败\')</code> 才会进入拒绝链。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>返回 <code>{ ok: false }</code>，期约算失败吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>仍是成功完成，业务结果表示失败而已。调用方要按约定检查字段，或者封装层统一转换成拒绝。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>在拒绝处理里返回错误对象，会继续失败吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，正常返回会恢复后续链的成功状态。要保留失败，重新抛出这个错误。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>throw \'失败\'</code> 可以拒绝吗，为什么还推荐错误对象？</strong></p>\\n<p>可以，拒绝原因没有必须为对象的限制。使用 <code>Error</code> 通常能保留堆栈和更明确的错误类型，便于排查。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-7-题目七\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-7-题目七\\">#</a> 3.7 题目七</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>回调返回本次 <code>then</code> 新建的期约 → 直接自引用</li>\\n<li>自己等自己，解析流程无法完成</li>\\n<li>结果是以 <code>TypeError</code> 拒绝，不是无限执行回调</li>\\n<li>返回之前已有的期约并非同一种循环</li>\\n<li>错误处理用有效函数，如 <code>console.error</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>这个期约在等待自己的结果，因此会以 <code>TypeError</code> 拒绝。</strong> <code>then</code> 先返回一个新的期约，稍后执行回调时，变量已经指向这个新对象；回调又把它原样返回，就形成了直接自引用。运行时会检测这种情况并拒绝，而不是一直重复执行回调。这里禁止的是返回本次链式调用产生的对象，不能扩大成回调里不能返回任何已有期约。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> promise <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\npromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>error<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>回调返回了这次 <code>then</code> 创建的期约自身，构成直接自引用；该期约会以 <code>TypeError</code> 拒绝，并由 <code>catch</code> 打印错误。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p>因此结果会报错：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token literal-property property\\">TypeError</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> Chaining cycle detected <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> promise #<span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span>Promise<span class=\\"token operator\\">></span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>回调引用变量时，不会触发暂时性死区吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>这里不会，回调是稍后运行的，变量已经完成初始化。问题出在返回对象与正在解析的新期约相同。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>返回调用 <code>then</code> 之前的那个成功期约，也会报错吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会仅因此报错，因为它不是本次新建的结果期约。新期约可以正常采用那个已有对象的结果。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>写 <code>catch(console.err)</code> 为什么没接住错误？</strong></p>\\n<p>标准控制台方法是 <code>console.error</code>，<code>console.err</code> 通常是 <code>undefined</code>。非函数会被忽略，拒绝继续传递。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>这个错误要用外层同步 <code>try/catch</code> 接吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>同步包住 <code>then</code> 调用接不到稍后的拒绝。用对应链的 <code>catch</code>，或者在异步函数中 <code>try { await promise } catch (...) {}</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-8-题目八\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-8-题目八\\">#</a> 3.8 题目八</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输出仍是 <code>1</code></li>\\n<li><code>then</code> 需要回调函数，数字与期约对象不算处理器</li>\\n<li>无有效成功处理器，成功值沿链传递</li>\\n<li>想改成 <code>3</code>，写 <code>then(() =&gt; 3)</code></li>\\n<li>参数表达式仍会先求值，忽略参数不等于没有副作用</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>最后仍然输出 <code>1</code>，因为前两个 <code>then</code> 都没有收到可调用的处理函数。</strong> 数字和期约对象不会被当成回调，所以它们不转换结果，最初的成功值继续向后传递。想改成 <code>3</code>，需要传函数并返回这个值。不过参数表达式本身照常求值，例如写 <code>then(fetch(url))</code> 仍会发请求，只是这个请求期约不会按预想加入链中等待。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code>Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>log<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>其实你只要记住原则8：.then 或者 .catch 的参数期望是函数，传入非函数则会发生值穿透。</li>\\n<li>第一个then和第二个then中传入的都不是函数，一个是数字类型，一个是对象类型，因此发生了穿透，将resolve(1) 的值直接传到最后一个then里。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>所以输出结果为：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>1\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把第二个参数写法换成 <code>then(() =&gt; Promise.resolve(3))</code> 呢？</strong></p>\\n<p>这次传入的是函数，执行后返回的期约会被采用。最后的成功值变成 <code>3</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>then(console.log)</code> 和 <code>then(console.log())</code> 一样吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不一样，前者传递函数，后者立即调用并把返回值传进去。日志方法通常返回 <code>undefined</code>，这就没有提供有效处理器。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>传入的期约被忽略，它就不会执行了吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，创建它时已经发生的操作仍会继续。被忽略的是它作为处理器的作用，不是撤销表达式执行。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>拒绝链上写 <code>catch(null)</code>，错误会消失吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，缺少有效拒绝处理器时，拒绝原因继续向后传递。仍要在后续接一个真正的函数处理。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-9-题目九\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-9-题目九\\">#</a> 3.9 题目九</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>then(onFulfilled, onRejected)</code> 两个回调是并列分支</li>\\n<li>只按上游状态选择其中一个</li>\\n<li>成功回调抛错，拒绝本次返回的新期约</li>\\n<li>同一次 <code>then</code> 的失败回调接不到这个新错误</li>\\n<li>后接 <code>catch</code> 能处理成功回调产生的拒绝</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>同一次 <code>then</code> 的失败回调，接不到它旁边成功回调抛出的错误。</strong> 这两个函数都处理上游期约的结果，上游成功就选择成功函数，上游失败才选择失败函数。成功函数运行后新产生的异常属于下一段链，会让 <code>then</code> 返回的期约拒绝，所以要由后面的 <code>catch</code> 接住。这也是 <code>then(success, fail)</code> 与 <code>then(success).catch(fail)</code> 不完全等价的原因。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>下面来介绍一下.then函数中的两个参数。</p>\\n<p>第一个参数是用来处理Promise成功的函数，第二个则是处理失败的函数。\\n也就是说Promise.resolve(\'1\')的值会进入成功的函数，Promise.reject(\'2\')的值会进入失败的函数。</p>\\n<p>让我们来看看这个例子</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code>Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'err!!!\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'success\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'error\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'catch\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>这里的执行结果是：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token string\\">\'error\'</span> <span class=\\"token string\\">\'err!!!\'</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>它进入的是then()中的第二个参数里面，而如果把第二个参数去掉，就进入了catch()中：</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code>Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'err!!!\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'success\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'catch\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>执行结果：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;catch&#39; &#39;err!!!&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>但是有一个问题，如果是这个案例呢？</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code>Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">success</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'error!!!\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">fail1</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'fail1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">fail2</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'fail2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>由于Promise调用的是resolve()，因此.then()执行的应该是success()函数，可是success()函数抛出的是一个错误，它会被后面的catch()给捕获到，而不是被fail1函数捕获。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p>因此执行结果为：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>fail2 Error: error!!!\\n\\t\\t\\tat success\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>上游拒绝，失败回调正常返回，后面的 <code>catch</code> 还会执行吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，失败已经被恢复，后续链以返回值成功。除非失败回调再次抛错或返回拒绝期约。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>成功处理里解析数据失败，错误处理应该放哪里？</strong></p>\\n<p>放在后续链上，例如 <code>request.then(parse).catch(handleError)</code>。这样既能处理请求拒绝，也能处理解析函数抛出的异常。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把失败回调同时传给两处，会执行两遍吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>要看错误是否继续传播。前一个处理正常返回后通常不会再进入后一个；重新抛出则可能两处都记录，需避免重复上报。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想只捕获请求错误，不吞掉后续处理错误，怎么接？</strong></p>\\n<p>可以用上游的并列拒绝处理，或把请求处理单独成段。明确每一段负责哪些失败，比在末尾统一吞掉所有异常更清楚。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_3-10-题目十\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_3-10-题目十\\">#</a> 3.10 题目十</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>finally</code> 适合清理，不接收成功值或拒绝原因</li>\\n<li>正常完成保留上游结果</li>\\n<li>抛错或返回拒绝期约，会替换后续失败原因</li>\\n<li>返回期约时会等待它完成</li>\\n<li>待定期约不会触发清理回调</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><code>finally</code> 像异步流程的收尾动作，通常不改变上游的成功值或失败原因。</strong> 无论前面走哪条分支，结果确定后都会运行它，适合关闭加载状态和释放资源。它不接收上游结果参数，普通返回值也不会替换原结果；但清理本身抛错或返回拒绝期约时，后面的链就会接收到这个新失败。需要读取结果的业务处理，还是放在成功或拒绝回调里。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>接着来看看.finally()，这个功能一般不太用在面试中，不过如果碰到了你也应该知道该如何处理。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">promise1</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> p<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">promise2</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'error\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">promise1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">finally</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'finally1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">promise2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">finally</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'finally2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>结果：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'1\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'error\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'finally1\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'finally2\'</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<h2 id=\\"_4-promise中的all和race\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_4-promise中的all和race\\">#</a> 4. Promise中的all和race</h2>\\n<ul>\\n<li>在做下面👇的题目之前，让我们先来了解一下Promise.all()和Promise.race()的用法。</li>\\n<li><code>Promise.all()</code> 聚合一组值或期约：全部成功后返回按输入顺序排列的结果，任一拒绝会使整体拒绝；任务何时启动取决于任务创建或调用位置。</li>\\n<li><code>Promise.race()</code> 采用最先兑现或拒绝的输入结果；它不会自动启动传入的普通函数，也不会取消其他底层任务。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>来看看题目一。</p>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>finally(() =&gt; 123)</code>，后面会拿到 <code>123</code> 吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，普通返回值被忽略，上游结果继续传递。要转换成功值应该用 <code>then</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>清理函数返回一个还没完成的期约，后面会等待吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>会，等清理成功再传递上游结果；如果清理拒绝，后续改为这个新拒绝。清理挂起也会拖住后面的链。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>请求一直待定，加载图标一定会在 <code>finally</code> 里关闭吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，没有确定结果就不会进入收尾。需要超时或取消机制让调用流程真正结束。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>清理日志接口失败，覆盖了真正的请求错误，怎么避免？</strong></p>\\n<p>如果这类清理失败不应影响主流程，就在清理内部明确处理它。不要让可忽略的辅助操作意外替换主要失败原因。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_4-1-题目一\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_4-1-题目一\\">#</a> 4.1 题目一</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>创建任务与聚合结果是两件事</li>\\n<li><code>runAsync(...)</code> 在调用时已经安排定时器</li>\\n<li><code>Promise.all</code> 全部成功后给出结果数组</li>\\n<li>数组按输入顺序，不按完成顺序</li>\\n<li>任一拒绝会让整体拒绝，不自动取消其他任务</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><code>Promise.all</code> 负责把多个结果收拢起来，任务通常在传进去之前就已经启动了。</strong> 这里三个函数调用各自创建定时器，约一秒后依次交付结果，全部成功后得到 <code>[1, 2, 3]</code>。就算完成顺序改变，结果数组仍按输入位置排列。它适合需要同时拿齐多份数据再继续的场景，但任何一个拒绝都会让整体失败，部分成功也要展示时应换一种聚合方式。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>我们知道如果直接在脚本文件中定义一个Promise，它构造函数的第一个参数是会立即执行的，就像这样：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>const p1 = new Promise(r =&gt; console.log(&#39;立即打印&#39;))\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>控制台中会立即打印出 “立即打印”。</p>\\n<p>因此为了控制它什么时候执行，我们可以用一个函数包裹着它，在需要它执行的时候，调用这个函数就可以了：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runP1</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n\\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> p1 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">r</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'立即打印\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> p1\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">runP1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 调用此函数时才执行</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>OK 👌， 让我们回归正题。\\n现在来构建这么一个函数：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">x</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n\\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">r</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">r</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> p\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>该函数传入一个值x，然后间隔一秒后打印出这个x。</li>\\n<li>如果我用<code>.all()</code>来执行它会怎样呢？</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">x</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n\\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">r</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">r</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\t<span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> p\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\nPromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">all</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>先来想想此段代码在浏览器中会如何执行？</li>\\n<li>没错，当你打开页面的时候，在间隔一秒后，控制台会同时打印出1, 2, 3，还有一个数组[1, 2, 3]。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>1\\n2\\n3\\n[1, 2, 3]\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>所以你现在能理解这句话的意思了吗：有了all，你就可以并行执行多个异步操作，并且在一个回调中处理所有的返回数据</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li>.all()后面的.then()里的回调函数接收的就是所有异步操作的结果。</li>\\n<li>而且这个结果中数组的顺序和Promise.all()接收到的数组顺序一致！！！</li>\\n</ul>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>有一个场景是很适合用这个的，一些游戏类的素材比较多的应用，打开网页时，预先加载需要用到的各种资源如图片、flash以及各种静态文件。所有的都加载完后，我们再进行页面的初始化。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>第二个请求最快，结果数组会把它放第一位吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，位置对应输入顺序。这样可以稳定地把每一项结果与原来的任务关联起来。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>传入 <code>[loadUser, loadOrders]</code>，两个函数会自动调用吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，普通函数会被当作普通值。要启动它们，需要写成 <code>loadUser()</code>、<code>loadOrders()</code> 或显式调度。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>三个结果里允许一个失败，页面还能显示另外两个，选什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>可以用 <code>Promise.allSettled</code>，逐项检查状态。也可以为特定任务提供明确备用值，再使用 <code>all</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>一个任务失败以后，其他网络请求会被自动取消吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，聚合结果失败不等于底层操作停止。需要主动通过请求支持的取消接口清理。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_4-2-题目二\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_4-2-题目二\\">#</a> 4.2 题目二</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>约一秒输出 <code>1、3</code>，约两秒输出 <code>2</code> 与拒绝原因</li>\\n<li><code>runReject(2)</code> 最先拒绝，整体采用它的原因</li>\\n<li>约四秒的任务仍运行并打印 <code>4</code></li>\\n<li><code>all</code> 的快速失败只决定聚合结果</li>\\n<li>延迟参数 <code>1000 * x</code> 的单位是毫秒</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>整体会以 <code>Error: 2</code> 拒绝，但较晚的任务仍然继续执行。</strong> 两个成功任务先交付结果，随后约两秒的任务拒绝，聚合期约立刻进入失败分支，不再等待所有任务成功。约四秒的任务依旧会打印日志，只是无法再次改变整体结果。这里的拒绝原因实际是字符串；如果希望保留堆栈和错误类型，可以在业务封装里使用 <code>Error</code> 对象。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p><code>runReject(x)</code> 安排的延迟是 <code>1000 * x</code> 毫秒，也就是 <code>x</code> 秒；时间到后以字符串作为拒绝原因。</p>\\n<p>同时.catch()函数能够捕获到.all()里最先的那个异常，并且只执行一次。</p>\\n<p>想想这道题会怎样执行呢 🤔️？</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">x</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">r</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">r</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> p\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runReject</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">x</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> rej</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">rej</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token template-string\\"><span class=\\"token template-punctuation string\\">`</span><span class=\\"token string\\">Error: </span><span class=\\"token interpolation\\"><span class=\\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\\">${</span>x<span class=\\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\\">}</span></span><span class=\\"token template-punctuation string\\">`</span></span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> p\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\nPromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">all</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runReject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">4</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runReject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n<span class=\\"token number\\">3</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 2s后输出</span>\\n<span class=\\"token number\\">2</span>\\n<span class=\\"token literal-property property\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 4s后输出</span>\\n<span class=\\"token number\\">4</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>没错，就像我之前说的，.catch是会捕获最先的那个异常，在这道题目中最先的异常就是runReject(2)的结果。</p>\\n<p>另外，如果一组异步操作中有一个异常都不会进入.then()的第一个回调函数参数中。</p>\\n<p>注意，为什么不说是不进入.then()中呢 🤔️？</p>\\n<p>哈哈，大家别忘了.then()方法的第二个参数也是可以捕获错误的：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code>Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">all</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runReject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">4</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runReject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> \\n  <span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>输入数组里四秒任务排在前面，为什么不采用它的错误？</strong></p>\\n<p>拒绝原因取决于哪个拒绝先影响聚合结果，不按输入位置选失败。输入顺序主要决定全部成功时结果数组的排列。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>已经进入 <code>catch</code>，四秒后为什么还有日志？</strong></p>\\n<p>底层定时器没有被取消。<code>Promise.all</code> 只改变聚合期约的状态，不管理所有任务的生命周期。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想拿到两个失败原因，继续用 <code>all</code> 行吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>直接用它拿不到完整结果集合。改用 <code>allSettled</code>，或者让每个任务把状态转换为明确的结果对象。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>失败分支打印完不再抛出，调用方看到什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>调用方如果等待的是处理后的链，会得到成功的 <code>undefined</code>。是否继续失败要在接口约定中说清楚。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_4-3-题目三\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_4-3-题目三\\">#</a> 4.3 题目三</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>race</code> 采用最先确定的成功或失败结果</li>\\n<li>示例先打印 <code>1</code>，再打印 <code>result: 1</code></li>\\n<li>后面的定时器仍继续打印 <code>2、3</code></li>\\n<li>不是“第一个成功”；首个拒绝同样会赢</li>\\n<li>超时竞争不等于取消请求</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><code>Promise.race</code> 只决定哪个结果先被采用，不会让输掉的任务停止。</strong> 这里第一个定时器交付 <code>1</code> 后，竞争结果的成功回调作为微任务运行，接着另外两个定时器仍会打印各自的日志。它常用于请求与超时竞争，但超时只让调用方停止等待，网络请求可能仍在继续。要释放资源，还需要结合实际请求的取消能力，并清理不再需要的定时器。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>所以使用.race()方法，它只会获取最先执行完成的那个结果，其它的异步任务虽然也会继续进行下去，不过race已经不管那些任务的结果了。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">x</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">r</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">r</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> p\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\nPromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">race</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'result: \'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\n</code></pre>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>1\\n&#39;result: &#39; 1\\n2\\n3\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>这个race有什么用呢？使用场景还是很多的，比如我们可以用race给某个异步请求设置超时时间，并且在超时后执行相应的操作</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>最快返回的是失败，<code>race</code> 会再等一个成功吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，它立刻采用这个拒绝。只想取首个成功结果时，可以考虑 <code>Promise.any</code> 并处理全部失败的情况。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>请求赢了，超时定时器还要清吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>应清理，避免不必要的回调和资源占用。聚合已经成功不会自动删除你创建的定时器。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>超时赢了，服务器就不会处理请求了吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能这样判断，客户端停止等待或中止连接都不保证服务器停止处理。涉及写入时还要考虑幂等与结果查询。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>Promise.race([])</code> 会马上成功吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，它会一直待定。空输入没有任何候选结果可以完成竞争。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_4-4-题目四\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_4-4-题目四\\">#</a> 4.4 题目四</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>首个零延迟任务拒绝，输出 <code>0</code> 与 <code>Error: 0</code></li>\\n<li>后面三个成功任务依旧会打印 <code>1、2、3</code></li>\\n<li><code>race</code> 看首个确定结果，成功失败都参与</li>\\n<li><code>all</code> 等全部成功，但遇拒绝会提前失败</li>\\n<li>聚合工具不自动调用普通函数，也不取消操作</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>零延迟的拒绝先到，整个竞争就会失败，后面的成功无法翻盘。</strong> 当前同步代码结束后，第一个定时器输出 <code>0</code> 并拒绝，错误处理随之拿到 <code>Error: 0</code>；约一秒后的任务仍继续输出自己的数字。选择聚合方法时要先说清业务目标：全部成功、首个结果、首个成功，还是每个任务的完整状态，这些需求对应不同的组合方式。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">x</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">r</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">r</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> p<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runReject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">x</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> rej</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">rej</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token template-string\\"><span class=\\"token template-punctuation string\\">`</span><span class=\\"token string\\">Error: </span><span class=\\"token interpolation\\"><span class=\\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\\">${</span>x<span class=\\"token interpolation-punctuation punctuation\\">}</span></span><span class=\\"token template-punctuation string\\">`</span></span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> p<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\nPromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">race</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token function\\">runReject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">runAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"result: \\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">err</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>err<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>遇到错误的话，也是一样的，在这道题中，<code>runReject(0)</code>最先执行完，所以进入了<code>catch()</code>中：</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>0\\n&#39;Error: 0&#39;\\n1\\n2\\n3\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><strong>总结</strong></p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>好的，让我们来总结一下.then()和.race()吧，😄</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>Promise.all()</code> 聚合输入值或期约：全部成功才成功，任一拒绝就拒绝；它不会自动调用输入的普通函数。</li>\\n<li><code>Promise.race()</code> 采用最先兑现或拒绝的结果，不取消其余底层任务；任务何时启动由任务本身决定。</li>\\n<li>Promise.all().then()结果中数组的顺序和Promise.all()接收到的数组顺序一致</li>\\n</ul>\\n<h2 id=\\"_5-async-await的几道题\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_5-async-await的几道题\\">#</a> 5. async/await的几道题</h2>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>既然谈到了Promise，那就肯定得再说说async/await，在很多时候async和Promise的解法差不多，又有些不一样。不信你来看看题目一。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想哪个接口成功就用哪个，最快失败不能结束，选哪个？</strong></p>\\n<p>用 <code>Promise.any</code> 更符合目标。它忽略尚有成功可能时的单个拒绝，全部拒绝才整体失败。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>所有请求都必须成功才能提交页面，用 <code>race</code> 行吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不行，<code>race</code> 只代表一个输入已经完成。使用 <code>Promise.all</code> 才能等待全部成功。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>某个请求永远没有结果，会让竞争一直挂住吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>只要另一个输入先确定结果，<code>race</code> 就能结束。若所有候选都待定，包括空输入，则会一直等待。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>四个任务已经开始，改用 <code>allSettled</code> 能限制并发吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，聚合方式不会撤销或限制已经开始的任务。限制并发要在调用任务函数之前加入调度。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_5-1-题目一\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_5-1-题目一\\">#</a> 5.1 题目一</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输出：<code>async1 start → async2 → start → async1 end</code></li>\\n<li><code>await</code> 先求值，立即调用 <code>async2()</code></li>\\n<li>暂停的是当前异步函数的后半段</li>\\n<li>不等待的 <code>new Promise</code> 不会让后续语句挂起</li>\\n<li>主线程继续运行外层同步代码</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong><code>await</code> 会暂停当前异步函数的后续代码，但不会暂停整个脚本。</strong> 调用 <code>async1</code> 后先打印开头，再立即调用 <code>async2</code> 打印它的日志；遇到等待点后，控制权回到外层，先打印 <code>start</code>。等对应的异步续体有机会执行，才打印 <code>async1 end</code>。如果只是创建一个期约而没有等待，后面的普通语句仍然同步继续运行。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async1 start\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async1 end\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async2\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>这道基础题输出的是啥？</p>\\n<p>答案：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;async1 start&#39;\\n&#39;async2&#39;\\n&#39;start&#39;\\n&#39;async1 end&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>首先一进来是创建了两个函数的，我们先不看函数的创建位置，而是看它的调用位置\\n发现async1函数被调用了，然后去看看调用的内容</li>\\n<li>执行函数中的同步代码async1 start，之后碰到了await，它会阻塞async1后面代码的执行，因此会先去执行async2中的同步代码async2，然后跳出async1</li>\\n<li>跳出async1函数后，执行同步代码start</li>\\n<li>在一轮宏任务全部执行完之后，再来执行刚刚await后面的内容async1 end。</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>（在这里，你可以理解为await后面的内容就相当于放到了Promise.then的里面）</p>\\n<p>来看看区别，如果我们把await async2()换成一个new Promise呢？</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async1 start\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async1 end\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"start\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>此时的执行结果为：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;async1 start&#39;\\n&#39;promise&#39;\\n&#39;async1 end&#39;\\n&#39;start&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>可以看到new Promise()并不会阻塞后面的同步代码async1 end的执行。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>async2</code> 没有异步操作，为什么后半段还要等？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>await</code> 的恢复仍然异步进行，即使等待的是已成功的期约或普通值。它不会因为结果立刻可用就变成同步接着执行。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>await</code> 会把浏览器页面卡住吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>等待本身不会占住主线程，外部代码和其他任务仍可运行。真正会卡住的是等待前后执行的重型同步计算。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把等待表达式换成 <code>new Promise(() =&gt; {})</code> 呢？</strong></p>\\n<p>如果仍有 <code>await</code>，后半段会一直等待，因为期约永远待定。去掉 <code>await</code> 才会直接继续往下执行。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>async2</code> 抛错，<code>async1 end</code> 还会打印吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>没有局部错误处理时不会，等待点会以抛错方式恢复，<code>async1</code> 返回的期约也会拒绝。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_5-2-题目二\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_5-2-题目二\\">#</a> 5.2 题目二</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输出：<code>async1 start → async2 → start → async1 end → timer</code></li>\\n<li><code>async2</code> 只安排定时器，没有等待它</li>\\n<li>函数返回时，定时器工作仍未完成</li>\\n<li><code>await async2()</code> 等函数结果，不自动追踪内部所有异步操作</li>\\n<li>要等定时器，需把完成信号纳入返回期约</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>外层等待的是 <code>async2</code> 返回的结果，不是它里面所有异步操作。</strong> <code>async2</code> 注册定时器后立即打印日志并返回，所以外层很快就能在微任务里继续执行，先打印结束文字；定时器留到后面的任务阶段才运行。这个区别在实际代码里很常见：异步函数里面启动了工作，不代表调用方的 <code>await</code> 就会自动等待那项工作结束。</p>\\n</section>\\n<ul>\\n<li>现在将async结合定时器看看。</li>\\n<li>给题目一中的 async2函数中加上一个定时器</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async1 start\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async1 end\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async2\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"start\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>这里 <code>async2()</code> 没有等待定时器，返回的期约很快成功，所以 <code>await</code> 的后续代码先执行，定时器回调随后才有机会运行；这不是所有异步代码里定时器都最后执行的通则。</p>\\n<p>答案：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;async1 start&#39;\\n&#39;async2&#39;\\n&#39;start&#39;\\n&#39;async1 end&#39;\\n&#39;timer&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>为什么函数加了 <code>async</code>，却没等内部定时器？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>async</code> 只管理函数返回的期约。没有等待或返回定时器的完成期约，它就不知道何时把这个工作算作完成。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想让结束日志出现在定时器后面，怎么改？</strong></p>\\n<p>在内部写 <code>await new Promise(resolve =&gt; setTimeout(resolve, 0))</code>，把定时器完成与函数结果关联起来。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把定时器延迟改成一秒，会延迟外层结束日志吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>当前写法不会，外层没有等待这个定时器。只是 <code>timer</code> 这条日志出现得更晚。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>内部发请求但不 <code>return</code> 也不 <code>await</code>，会有同样问题吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>会，调用方可能过早认为操作完成。除非刻意设计成后台任务，否则应该把请求纳入函数返回链。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_5-3-题目三\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_5-3-题目三\\">#</a> 5.3 题目三</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>同步先输出：<code>async1 start、async2、start</code></li>\\n<li>等待恢复后输出 <code>async1 end</code>，才注册 <code>timer1</code></li>\\n<li>定时器注册顺序：<code>timer2 → timer3 → timer1</code></li>\\n<li>示例中定时器依次按这个顺序输出</li>\\n<li>行号顺序不等于异步函数内部语句的执行顺序</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>三个定时器的关键顺序是先注册 <code>timer2</code>，再注册 <code>timer3</code>，最后才注册 <code>timer1</code>。</strong> <code>async1</code> 在等待处暂停时，内部的 <code>async2</code> 已经安排了第二个定时器；控制权回到外层，又安排第三个。之后微任务恢复 <code>async1</code>，打印结束日志并安排第一个。它们延迟相同，所以这个例子里会按上述注册顺序运行，而不是按变量编号排列。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async1 start\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async1 end\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async2\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer3\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"start\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>其实如果你能做到这里了，说明你前面的那些知识点也都掌握了，我就不需要太过详细的步骤分析了。</p>\\n<p>直接公布答案吧：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 start\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'async2\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'start\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 end\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer2\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer3\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer1\'</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>定时器谁先执行，你只需要关注谁先被调用的以及延迟时间是多少，这道题中延迟时间都是0，所以只要关注谁先被调用的。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>timer1</code> 写在第一个函数里，为什么注册得最晚？</strong></p>\\n<p>它位于 <code>await</code> 后面，必须等函数恢复才能执行注册语句。函数定义位置不决定里面每行代码的执行时间。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>去掉 <code>await</code>，三个定时器的顺序会怎样？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>async2</code> 先注册 <code>timer2</code>，接着 <code>async1</code> 继续注册 <code>timer1</code>，外层才注册 <code>timer3</code>。顺序因此变成第二、第一、第三。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把 <code>timer3</code> 延迟改得更长，还能只看注册顺序吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，还要看各自的计时条件和实际调度。相同延迟的这个示例不能替代所有定时器场景。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>等待的期约一直待定，哪个定时器不会被注册？</strong></p>\\n<p><code>timer1</code> 不会，因为恢复点之后的代码没有运行。已经在等待前或外层注册的其他定时器仍会继续。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_5-4-题目四\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_5-4-题目四\\">#</a> 5.4 题目四</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>async</code> 调用返回期约，普通返回值成为成功值</li>\\n<li><code>return 123</code> → 调用方取得 <code>123</code></li>\\n<li><code>await 123</code> 合法，后续执行仍会异步恢复</li>\\n<li><code>return await</code> 与直接返回不保证所有时序相同</li>\\n<li>是否等待，要结合局部错误处理判断</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>异步函数可以直接返回普通值，调用方通过期约拿到它。</strong> 这里写 <code>return 123</code>，最终成功回调就收到数字 <code>123</code>，不需要手动再包一层构造器。普通值也可以被 <code>await</code>，只是等待后的代码仍要异步恢复。讨论两种写法时，可以说最终值相同，但不能因此断言它们在执行时机和局部错误处理上处处等价。</p>\\n</section>\\n<ul>\\n<li>正常情况下，async中的await命令是一个Promise对象，返回该对象的结果。</li>\\n<li>但如果不是Promise对象的话，就会直接返回对应的值，相当于Promise.resolve()</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">fn</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 返回普通值时，调用方通过 then 或 await 得到 123</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// return await 123 也能得到相同值，但会引入等待点</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">123</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">fn</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>结果：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>123\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>调用 <code>fn()</code> 后，直接相加能得到 <code>124</code> 吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能直接把返回期约当成数字。先用 <code>const value = await fn()</code>，再进行运算。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>异步函数没有 <code>return</code>，最终结果是什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>正常结束时会以 <code>undefined</code> 成功。出现未处理异常则拒绝，不能只看有没有返回语句。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>等待普通数字会阻塞线程吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，当前异步函数会暂停并稍后恢复，外层同步代码继续运行。普通值不需要实际等待网络，但仍存在异步恢复边界。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>在局部 <code>try/catch</code> 里直接返回请求，能捕获它后来的拒绝吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>直接返回期约时局部捕获通常接不到后来的拒绝。使用 <code>return await request()</code>，拒绝会在等待处以异常方式进入局部捕获。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_5-5-题目五\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_5-5-题目五\\">#</a> 5.5 题目五</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>同步日志：脚本开始 → 函数开始 → 执行器 → 脚本结束</li>\\n<li>等待的期约没有完成路径，保持 <code>pending</code></li>\\n<li>等待后面的成功日志与返回语句不运行</li>\\n<li>外层成功回调也继续等待</li>\\n<li>执行器没有 <code>return</code>，不是待定的原因</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>外层脚本能继续结束，但异步函数会一直等在那个没有结果的期约上。</strong> 执行器里的日志同步打印以后，既没有成功或失败调用，也没有异常，所以等待无法恢复。后面的成功文字和返回值都不会产生，外层的成功回调自然也不会运行。排查这种挂起时，应该检查完成路径是否遗漏，不能把执行器没有写返回值当成原因。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 success\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 end\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script end\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>被等待的期约既没有调用 <code>resolve</code> 或 <code>reject</code>，也没有抛错，因此一直待定。执行器是否使用 <code>return</code> 与完成状态无关。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p>所以在await之后的内容是不会执行的，也包括async1后面的 .then。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script start\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 start\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'script end\'</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>给执行器补上 <code>return \'ok\'</code>，能继续吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，普通返回值不会完成构造器创建的期约。要调用 <code>resolve(\'ok\')</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>等待中的函数会挡住外面的脚本结束日志吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，暂停的是这个异步函数的续体，外层同步代码照常运行。待定不等于主线程被同步循环占住。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>外层加 <code>finally</code>，能让函数继续吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，收尾回调也要等期约确定结果。需要修复完成路径，或为等待设置明确的超时和取消策略。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>拒绝这个期约以后，成功日志会出现吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>没有局部错误处理时不会，等待处会抛出拒绝原因。函数返回的期约也会拒绝，需要调用方处理。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_5-6-题目六\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_5-6-题目六\\">#</a> 5.6 题目六</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>同步执行器先打印 <code>promise1</code> 并调用 <code>resolve</code></li>\\n<li>内层成功回调输出 <code>promise1 resolve</code></li>\\n<li><code>await</code> 等的是内层 <code>then</code> 返回的新期约</li>\\n<li>链完成后打印 <code>async1 success</code></li>\\n<li>最外层回调最后取得 <code>async1 end</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>等待恢复要等内层整条链完成，而不只是最初那个期约成功。</strong> 执行器先同步打印日志并完成期约，外层脚本继续运行；随后内层成功回调打印结果，它正常结束以后，被等待的新期约才成功。异步函数接着打印成功文字并返回自己的结果，最外面的回调最后拿到这个返回值。看清 <code>await</code> 后面完整的表达式，才能判断到底在等谁。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>让我们给5.5中的Promise加上resolve：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1 resolve\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 success\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 end\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script end\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>内部期约成功，随后它的 <code>then</code> 回调也正常完成，被等待的链因此成功，异步函数可以恢复：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;script start&#39;\\n&#39;async1 start&#39;\\n&#39;promise1&#39;\\n&#39;script end&#39;\\n&#39;promise1 resolve&#39;\\n&#39;async1 success&#39;\\n&#39;async1 end&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>内层成功回调没有返回值，会一直待定吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，正常结束相当于返回 <code>undefined</code>，新期约会成功。执行器与成功处理回调的返回语义不同。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>在内层成功回调返回另一个请求，会继续等吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>会，这条链会采用返回期约的结果。外层等待因此包含新增的请求。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>内层回调抛错，外层成功文字还会打印吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，除非等待附近有捕获并恢复。新期约拒绝会在 <code>await</code> 处变成异常。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想保存内层成功值，能直接等这段日志回调吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>这段回调只打印而不返回，等待结果是 <code>undefined</code>。需要在回调里 <code>return res</code>，或者直接等待最初的期约再打印。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_5-7-题目七\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_5-7-题目七\\">#</a> 5.7 题目七</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>同步先输出脚本开始、函数开始、<code>promise1</code>、<code>promise2</code></li>\\n<li>等待恢复后输出 <code>async1 success</code></li>\\n<li>外层得到函数返回的 <code>async1 end</code></li>\\n<li>内层 <code>resolve</code> 值不会自动成为函数返回值</li>\\n<li>另一条待定期约不妨碍独立定时器运行</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>调用方拿到什么，取决于异步函数最终返回什么。</strong> 内部期约以 <code>promise resolve</code> 成功，只负责让等待恢复；函数没有把这个值返回出去，而是明确返回 <code>async1 end</code>，所以外层收到后者。另一段期约执行器里的 <code>promise2</code> 是同步日志，它安排的定时器则稍后运行。即使那个期约一直待定，也不会自动取消它已经注册的定时器。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise resolve\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 success\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 end\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>这道题应该也不难，不过有一点需要注意的，在async1中的new Promise它的resovle的值和async1().then()里的值是没有关系的，很多小伙伴可能看到resovle(\'promise resolve\')就会误以为是async1().then()中的返回值。</p>\\n<p>因此这里的执行结果为：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script start\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 start\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise2\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 success\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 end\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer\'</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想把内部结果交给调用方，最直接怎么写？</strong></p>\\n<p>可以保存后返回：<code>const value = await task; return value</code>。也可以直接返回任务期约，让异步函数采用它的结果。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>删掉异步函数最后的返回语句，会收到什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>正常结束时收到 <code>undefined</code>。内部曾经成功得到某个值，不代表它会自动成为外部返回值。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>第二个期约一直待定，为什么 <code>timer</code> 还能打印？</strong></p>\\n<p>定时器在执行器运行时就注册了。期约状态不会决定这个独立回调有没有调度机会。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>内部结果不使用，是否就不用等待了？</strong></p>\\n<p>不一定，可能需要保证副作用完成后再进行下一步。是否等待取决于顺序要求，不只取决于是否使用返回值。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_5-8-题目八\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_5-8-题目八\\">#</a> 5.8 题目八</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>先列五条同步日志，不把执行器后移</li>\\n<li><code>await async2()</code> 的恢复先安排</li>\\n<li>后注册的成功回调随后执行</li>\\n<li>微任务输出 <code>async1 end → promise2</code></li>\\n<li>定时器最后输出 <code>setTimeout</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>这段代码先完成同步日志，再按入队顺序恢复等待与执行成功回调。</strong> 同步阶段依次是脚本开始、函数开始、<code>async2</code>、<code>promise1</code> 和脚本结束；这里等待的是立即正常结束的异步函数，恢复动作早于后面显式注册的成功回调，所以先打印 <code>async1 end</code>，再打印 <code>promise2</code>。定时器等到后续任务才执行。推导时要区分执行器的同步运行与成功回调的异步运行。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>我们再来看一道头条曾经的面试题：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async1 start\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async1 end\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"async2\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"script start\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"setTimeout\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"promise1\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"promise2\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script end\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;script start&#39;\\n&#39;async1 start&#39;\\n&#39;async2&#39;\\n&#39;promise1&#39;\\n&#39;script end&#39;\\n&#39;async1 end&#39;\\n&#39;promise2&#39;\\n&#39;setTimeout&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>(这道题最后async1 end和promise2的顺序其实在网上饱受争议，我这里使用浏览器Chrome V80，Node v12.16.1的执行结果都是上面这个答案)</p>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把后面的期约整段移到 <code>async1()</code> 前，会影响微任务顺序吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>会改变回调的注册与入队顺序，需要重新推导。微任务不是按函数名称或是否使用 <code>await</code> 固定排序。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>async2</code> 等一个一秒请求，结束日志还会在定时器前吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不一定，等待的结果尚未准备好，函数无法立即恢复。现有定时器可能先获得执行机会。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>看到旧文章给出相反顺序，怎么核实？</strong></p>\\n<p>先确认代码是否完全相同，再在目标运行环境执行最小示例。历史实现变化和等待对象的差别都可能影响推导。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>期约构造器里的 <code>promise1</code> 为什么不算微任务？</strong></p>\\n<p>构造器会立即调用执行器。微任务是之后的成功反应，不是整个期约相关代码都异步运行。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_5-9-题目九\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_5-9-题目九\\">#</a> 5.9 题目九</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>两个 <code>await</code> 把函数分成三段</li>\\n<li>第一次恢复打印第一个结果，再调用第二个函数</li>\\n<li>外部成功回调在第二次等待期间执行</li>\\n<li>第二次恢复后打印 <code>hello async</code> 和两个结果</li>\\n<li>返回期约要采用其结果，不等同于同步拿值</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>多个等待点要逐段分析，不能把整个异步函数的后半段一次排完。</strong> 开头同步执行到第一次等待，外层继续创建期约并打印脚本结束；第一次恢复后，函数打印首个结果并调用第二个异步函数，又在第二个等待点暂停。外部已排队的成功回调趁这段间隙执行，之后函数才拿到第二个结果。每次恢复都可能继续运行同步代码，也可能再次挂起。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">testSometing</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"执行testSometing\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token string\\">\\"testSometing\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">testAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"执行testAsync\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"hello async\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">test</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"test start...\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> v1 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">testSometing</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>v1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> v2 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">testAsync</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>v2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>v1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> v2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">test</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> promise <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"promise start...\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"promise\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\npromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">val</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>val<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"test end...\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>答案：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token string\\">\'test start...\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'执行testSometing\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise start...\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'test end...\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'testSometing\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'执行testAsync\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'hello async\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token string\\">\'testSometing\'</span> <span class=\\"token string\\">\'hello async\'</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<h2 id=\\"_6-async处理错误\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_6-async处理错误\\">#</a> 6. async处理错误</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>为什么 <code>执行testAsync</code> 会先于外面的 <code>promise</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p>第一次等待恢复时，调用第二个函数属于这段续体里的同步操作。这个调用完成到新的等待点后，才让出执行机会。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>两个函数互不依赖，能同时启动吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>可以先调用两者拿到期约，再用 <code>Promise.all</code> 等待。当前写法要等第一个完成才调用第二个，属于串行启动。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>第二个函数返回普通字符串，会影响最终值吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>最终仍可得到同一个字符串，但内部采用期约的过程和调度细节可能不同。不要只凭最终结果就断言每一步时序完全相同。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>第一个等待拒绝，第二个函数还会调用吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>没有捕获恢复时不会。执行会从第一个等待点走异常路径，后续调用被跳过。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_6-1-题目一\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_6-1-题目一\\">#</a> 6.1 题目一</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li><code>await</code> 等到拒绝，会以异常方式恢复</li>\\n<li>没有局部捕获，后续普通语句跳过</li>\\n<li>异步函数返回的期约也会拒绝</li>\\n<li>只注册成功回调不算处理错误</li>\\n<li>错误对象作为普通值，与拒绝状态不同</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>等待拒绝的期约，就像在等待位置抛出异常。</strong> 这里先同步打印 <code>async2</code>，随后拒绝向上影响等待它的函数，后面的成功文字与返回语句不会执行。调用方只提供了成功回调，没有接住拒绝，所以运行环境可能报告未处理错误。要么在异步函数内部捕获并决定如何恢复，要么把拒绝交给调用方处理，不能指望成功回调替代错误处理。</p>\\n</section>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>在async中，如果 await后面的内容是一个异常或者错误的话，会怎样呢？</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 success\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async2</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'error\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>例如这道题中，await后面跟着的是一个状态为rejected的promise。</p>\\n<p>如果在async函数中抛出了错误，则终止错误结果，不会继续向下执行。</p>\\n<p>所以答案为：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;async2&#39;\\nUncaught (in promise) error\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>如果改为throw new Error也是一样的：</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>async function async1 () {\\n  console.log(&#39;async1&#39;);\\n  throw new Error(&#39;error!!!&#39;)\\n  return &#39;async1 success&#39;\\n}\\nasync1().then(res =&gt; console.log(res))\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>结果为：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;async1&#39;\\nUncaught (in promise) Error: error!!!\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>await new Error(\'失败\')</code> 也会抛错吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，它只是等待一个普通对象，结果仍是这个对象。<code>await Promise.reject(error)</code> 才会以拒绝原因抛出。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>异步函数开头直接抛错，外层同步捕获能接到吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>调用异步函数会得到拒绝期约，外层同步包住调用通常接不到。需要 <code>await</code> 后捕获，或者接 <code>catch</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>加一个空 <code>catch</code>，后面就能继续了吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>可以恢复，但也会吞掉失败信息。只有业务允许忽略时才这么做，否则应提供备用结果或继续抛出。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>浏览器一定显示相同的未处理错误文字吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不一定，报告格式由环境决定。确定的结论是返回链处于拒绝状态且缺少处理器。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_6-2-题目二\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_6-2-题目二\\">#</a> 6.2 题目二</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>在等待点外包 <code>try/catch</code>，捕获拒绝原因</li>\\n<li>捕获后正常结束，可以继续后续语句</li>\\n<li>上游先接 <code>catch</code> 也能把失败变成成功结果</li>\\n<li>两种写法注意捕获范围，不是只换语法</li>\\n<li>要保留失败，就在处理后重新抛出</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>捕获并恢复错误以后，异步函数可以继续往下执行。</strong> 这段代码在等待拒绝结果时先暂停，所以外面的脚本日志先输出；恢复后进入捕获分支打印错误，再执行函数后续内容，最后把成功值交给调用方。也可以在被等待的期约上先处理拒绝，不过那只覆盖对应链路。选择写法时要看希望把哪些失败算在同一段处理范围内。</p>\\n</section>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>如果想要使得错误的地方不影响async函数后续的执行的话，可以使用try catch</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">try</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'error!!!\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>e<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>e<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 success\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>这里的结果为：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;script start&#39;\\n&#39;error!!!&#39;\\n&#39;async1&#39;\\n&#39;async1 success&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>或者你可以直接在Promise.reject后面跟着一个catch()方法：</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// try {</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">//   await Promise.reject(\'error!!!\')</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// } catch(e) {</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">//   console.log(e)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// }</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'error!!!\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">e</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>e<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 success\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<h2 id=\\"_7-综合题\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_7-综合题\\">#</a> 7. 综合题</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把 <code>try</code> 里的 <code>await</code> 去掉，还能捕获请求拒绝吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>通常不能，异步拒绝发生时同步代码块已经结束。要等待它，或者直接在返回链上接拒绝处理。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>错误处理返回备用值，<code>await</code> 能收到吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>能，例如 <code>const data = await request.catch(() =&gt; cached)</code>。但备用值类型要与后续业务预期一致。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>catch</code> 里又抛出新错误，会不会继续执行成功日志？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，异常继续向外传播，异步函数返回的期约拒绝。要恢复就必须让捕获分支正常完成。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>只想处理网络失败，不想吞掉数据处理错误，怎么缩小范围？</strong></p>\\n<p>把网络等待放进单独的捕获块，后续数据处理留在外面。或者只给请求期约接局部拒绝处理。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_7-1-题目一\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_7-1-题目一\\">#</a> 7.1 题目一</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>同步输出：<code>3 → 7 → 4</code></li>\\n<li>内层与外层是两个不同期约</li>\\n<li>微任务先打印内层 <code>1</code>，再打印外层 <code>2</code></li>\\n<li>定时器随后打印 <code>5</code> 与内层期约</li>\\n<li>第二次 <code>resolve(6)</code> 不覆盖已经成功的 <code>1</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>内外两层期约分别完成，输出顺序是 <code>3、7、4、1、2、5</code>，然后是内层期约对象。</strong> 调用函数时两个执行器立即运行，所以先看到前两条数字日志；内层成功回调比外层更早注册，同步结束后依次打印 <code>1</code> 和 <code>2</code>。定时器最后运行，虽然再次交付 <code>6</code>，但内层已经以 <code>1</code> 成功，结果不会被覆盖。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">first</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">7</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n            console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">5</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n            <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">6</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n          \\tconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>p<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n        <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    p<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arg</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n        console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arg<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">first</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">arg</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>arg<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">4</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<ul>\\n<li>第一段代码定义的是一个函数，所以我们得看看它是在哪执行的，发现它在4之前，所以可以来看看first函数里面的内容了。(这一步有点类似于题目1.5)</li>\\n<li>函数first返回的是一个new Promise()，因此先执行里面的同步代码3</li>\\n<li>接着又遇到了一个new Promise()，直接执行里面的同步代码7</li>\\n<li>执行完7之后，在p中，遇到了一个定时器，先将它放到下一个宏任务队列里不管它，接着向下走</li>\\n<li>碰到了resolve(1)，这里就把p的状态改为了resolved，且返回值为1，不过这里也先不执行</li>\\n<li>跳出p，碰到了resolve(2)，这里的resolve(2)，表示的是把first函数返回的那个Promise的状态改了，也先不管它。</li>\\n<li>然后碰到了p.then，将它加入本次循环的微任务列表，等待执行</li>\\n<li>跳出first函数，遇到了first().then()，将它加入本次循环的微任务列表(p.then的后面执行)</li>\\n<li>然后执行同步代码4</li>\\n<li>本轮的同步代码全部执行完毕，查找微任务列表，发现p.then和first().then()，依次执行，打印出1和2</li>\\n<li>本轮任务执行完毕了，发现还有一个定时器没有跑完，接着执行这个定时器里的内容，执行同步代码5</li>\\n<li>然后又遇到了一个<code>resolve(6)</code>，它是放在p里的，但是p的状态在之前已经发生过改变了，因此这里就不会再改变，也就是说<code>resolve(6)</code>相当于没任何用处，因此打印出来的p为<code>Promise{&lt;resolved&gt;: 1}</code>。(这一步类似于题目3.1)</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>3\\n7\\n4\\n1\\n2\\n5\\nPromise{&lt;resolved&gt;: 1}\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>两个参数都叫 <code>resolve</code>，会不会操作同一个期约？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，它们属于不同执行器的局部作用域。内层调用影响内层对象，外层调用影响函数返回的那个对象。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>外层先调用 <code>resolve(2)</code>，为什么日志还是先 <code>1</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p>结果确定时还没有注册外层回调。真正的反应入队顺序是先调用内层 <code>then</code>，再调用外层 <code>then</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>删掉内层同步的 <code>resolve(1)</code>，会怎样？</strong></p>\\n<p>内层要等定时器交付 <code>6</code> 才完成。外层的成功回调可以先执行，内层日志则移到定时器结束后的微任务。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>定时器里的 <code>console.log(p)</code> 会读到未初始化变量吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>这里不会，定时器稍后执行时，变量已经接收了构造结果。如果在执行器同步阶段就读取该变量，才要考虑初始化问题。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_7-2-题目二\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_7-2-题目二\\">#</a> 7.2 题目二</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>同步输出脚本开始、<code>async1</code>、<code>promise1</code>、脚本结束</li>\\n<li>待定期约让 <code>async1 end</code> 永远等不到</li>\\n<li>非函数处理器被忽略，独立链最终输出 <code>1</code></li>\\n<li>一秒定时器先于两秒定时器运行</li>\\n<li>一条链挂起，不代表其他异步工作停止</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>这段代码有三组独立的异步工作：一条等待不结束，一条正常传值，两只定时器照常计时。</strong> 异步函数等待的期约没有完成路径，所以它的后半段和外层成功回调都不会运行。另一条链传入的数字与对象不是处理函数，成功值 <code>1</code> 一直传到最后。同步日志之后先看到这个数字，再看到较短延迟的 <code>timer2</code>，随后是 <code>timer1</code>。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">async1</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'promise1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 end\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token string\\">\'async1 success\'</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span> \\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script start\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">async1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nconsole<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'script end\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\nPromise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">catch</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">4</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><strong>注意的知识点：</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>被等待的期约一直待定，异步函数就无法恢复；执行器的普通返回值不会完成期约，必须检查完成调用或异常路径</li>\\n<li>.then函数中的参数期待的是函数，如果不是函数的话会发生穿透(类似题3.8 )</li>\\n<li>注意定时器的延迟时间</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;script start&#39;\\n&#39;async1&#39;\\n&#39;promise1&#39;\\n&#39;script end&#39;\\n1\\n&#39;timer2&#39;\\n&#39;timer1&#39;\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>异步函数卡在等待点，之前安排的定时器会取消吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，注册好的定时器独立等待调度。期约待定只影响依赖它的续体。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>catch(4)</code> 会把结果变成数字 <code>4</code> 吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，它不是函数，会被忽略。这里又没有拒绝，成功值继续沿链传递。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>给待定期约补一个延迟成功，哪些日志会新增？</strong></p>\\n<p>它完成后，异步函数会恢复并打印结束文字，再把返回值交给外层成功回调。具体位置取决于完成时机。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>把两个定时器的延迟交换，数字 <code>1</code> 也会换位置吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会仅因此改变，数字来自当前任务后处理的微任务链。交换影响的是两只定时器之间的执行先后。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_7-3-题目三\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_7-3-题目三\\">#</a> 7.3 题目三</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>第一次成功值决定源期约结果</li>\\n<li><code>then</code> 打印值，但没有把值继续返回</li>\\n<li><code>finally</code> 参数为 <code>undefined</code>，不接收上游值</li>\\n<li>最终 <code>p1</code> 是整条链的期约，成功值为 <code>undefined</code></li>\\n<li>定时器里的后续 <code>resolve</code> 不再生效</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>最终 <code>p1</code> 的成功值是 <code>undefined</code>，因为中间的成功回调没有返回值。</strong> 最初的期约采用第一次有效交付的字符串，后续成功调用无法覆盖；成功回调打印它以后正常结束，让下一段以 <code>undefined</code> 成功。<code>finally</code> 本身又不接收上游结果，所以日志里的参数也是 <code>undefined</code>。定时器稍后观察到的 <code>p1</code> 是整条链的结果，不是最初那个构造器对象。</p>\\n</section>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> p1 <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'resolve3\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'timer1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'resolve1\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'resolve2\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>p1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">finally</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'finally\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p><strong>注意的知识点：</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>Promise的状态一旦改变就无法改变(类似题目3.5)</li>\\n<li>finally不管Promise的状态是resolved还是rejected都会执行，且它的回调函数是没有参数的(类似3.10)</li>\\n</ul>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>&#39;resolve1&#39;\\n&#39;finally&#39; undefined\\n&#39;timer1&#39;\\nPromise{&lt;resolved&gt;: undefined}\\n</code></pre>\\n<h2 id=\\"_8-几道大厂的面试题\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_8-几道大厂的面试题\\">#</a> 8. 几道大厂的面试题</h2>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>想让最终链保留第一次成功值，哪里要加返回？</strong></p>\\n<p>在成功回调末尾写 <code>return res</code>。正常完成的 <code>finally</code> 会继续保留这个上游值。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>finally</code> 里定义参数，就能收到成功值吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，调用时不会传入上游结果。声明一个形参只会让它得到 <code>undefined</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>一秒后的日志打印的是源期约吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不是，变量接收了末尾 <code>finally</code> 返回的对象。分析链式赋值时，要追到整个表达式的返回值。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>finally</code> 返回拒绝期约，最终对象还会成功吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，收尾阶段的拒绝会成为后续结果。定时器观察时会看到拒绝，还需要为这条链处理错误。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_8-1-使用promise实现每隔1秒输出1-2-3\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_8-1-使用promise实现每隔1秒输出1-2-3\\">#</a> 8.1 使用Promise实现每隔1秒输出1,2,3</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>延时函数：<code>const wait = ms =&gt; new Promise(r =&gt; setTimeout(r, ms))</code></li>\\n<li>串行等待，再打印当前数字</li>\\n<li><code>reduce</code> 方案每步必须返回延时期约</li>\\n<li><code>for...of</code> 配合 <code>await</code> 更直观</li>\\n<li>相邻间隔约一秒，不是精准时钟保证</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>要每隔一秒输出一个数字，就让下一次计时等上一次结束后再开始。</strong> 可以用 <code>reduce</code> 不断连接成功回调，每一步返回一个延时期约；也可以在异步函数里写 <code>for (const n of [1, 2, 3]) { await wait(1000); console.log(n) }</code>。关键是保留等待关系。一次性循环启动三个一秒定时器，会让它们几乎同时到期，而不是形成逐项间隔。</p>\\n</section>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>这道题比较简单的一种做法是可以用Promise配合着reduce不停的在promise后面叠加.then，请看下面的代码：</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> arr <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span>\\narr<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">reduce</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">p<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> x</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> p<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">r</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">r</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>x<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>或者你可以更简单一点写：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-text\\"><code>const arr = [1, 2, 3]\\narr.reduce((p, x) =&gt; p.then(() =&gt; new Promise(r =&gt; setTimeout(() =&gt; r(console.log(x)), 1000))), Promise.resolve())\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>在 <code>then</code> 里创建延时期约但不返回，会怎样？</strong></p>\\n<p>下一步不会等待它，后续阶段很快继续，多个定时器会接近同时启动。必须返回期约或使用 <code>await</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>forEach(async n =&gt; ...)</code> 能保证串行吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，<code>forEach</code> 不会等待回调返回的期约。使用 <code>for...of</code> 或显式的期约链。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>第一条数字想立即输出，之后再等一秒，怎么改？</strong></p>\\n<p>把打印放在等待前面，并避免最后一次无意义等待。先说明首次触发时机，才能判断实现是否符合需求。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>每一步还要处理耗时工作，会不会越跑越偏？</strong></p>\\n<p>会，逐次等待会累积处理时间与调度延迟。需要对齐固定时间线时，按目标时间计算下一次剩余延迟。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_8-2-使用promise实现红绿灯交替重复亮\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_8-2-使用promise实现红绿灯交替重复亮\\">#</a> 8.2 使用Promise实现红绿灯交替重复亮</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>单步动作返回可等待的期约</li>\\n<li>红、绿、黄按约定顺序串行连接</li>\\n<li>时长对应颜色，别把绿灯与黄灯参数写反</li>\\n<li>一轮结束再开始下一轮，不阻塞同步调用栈</li>\\n<li>循环要能停止，定时器与失败都要有出口</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>交替亮灯的本质是重复执行一组有等待关系的步骤。</strong> 把每一步封装成延时后执行动作的期约，依次等待红、绿、黄，再开始下一轮即可。这里还要明确时间含义：是等多久后点亮，还是点亮以后保持多久，两种需求的动作顺序不同。按红三秒、绿一秒、黄两秒的约定配置，并提供停止入口，才能让演示逻辑安全用于实际页面。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>红灯3秒亮一次，黄灯2秒亮一次，绿灯1秒亮一次；如何让三个灯不断交替重复亮灯？（用Promise实现）三个亮灯函数已经存在：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">red</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'red\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">green</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'green\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">yellow</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'yellow\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>答案：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">red</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"red\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">green</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"green\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">yellow</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"yellow\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">light</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">timer<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> cb</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token function\\">cb</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> timer<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">step</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">light</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> red<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">light</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> green<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">light</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> yellow<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">step</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">step</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>要求红灯立刻亮并保持三秒，动作应该放在哪里？</strong></p>\\n<p>先执行红灯动作，再等待三秒，然后切下一种颜色。等待结束才点亮，表达的是延迟点亮，时间语义不同。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>一轮结束递归调用，会很快撑爆调用栈吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>每轮经过异步等待，普通同步调用栈会退出，因此不同于同步无限递归。不过长期循环仍需关注清理和停止条件。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>页面卸载了，怎么防止灯还在切换？</strong></p>\\n<p>设置停止信号并清理当前定时器，每次恢复后再检查信号。只清一个定时器但保留无退出条件的循环不够。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>某次亮灯函数抛错，整条链会自动拒绝吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>如果动作在定时器回调里直接抛出，构造器不会自动捕获它。需要在异步回调内部捕获并拒绝，或者先等待再在期约链里执行动作。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_8-3-实现mergepromise函数\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_8-3-实现mergepromise函数\\">#</a> 8.3 实现mergePromise函数</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>输入必须是尚未执行的任务函数</li>\\n<li>每个任务等待上一个成功后才调用</li>\\n<li>结果按任务顺序收集</li>\\n<li>返回整条链，空列表返回 <code>[]</code></li>\\n<li>失败后停止还是继续，要明确约定</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>串行调度要控制任务函数的调用时机，不能等任务都启动后再尝试排序。</strong> 可以把每个函数接到前一个期约的成功分支，取得结果后存入数组，再继续调用下一项。异步循环同样清楚：<code>for (const task of tasks) results.push(await task())</code>。最后返回结果数组，空输入也得到空数组；如果某项失败且没有恢复，后续任务就不会启动。</p>\\n</section>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>实现mergePromise函数，把传进去的数组按顺序先后执行，并且把返回的数据先后放到数组data中。</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">time</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">timer</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token function\\">setTimeout</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> timer<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">ajax1</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">time</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">ajax2</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">time</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">2</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">2</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">ajax3</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">time</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">1000</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">3</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">mergePromise</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 在这里写代码</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">mergePromise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>ajax1<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> ajax2<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> ajax3<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">data</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"done\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>data<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// data 为 [1, 2, 3]</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 要求分别输出</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 1</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 2</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 3</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// done</span>\\n<span class=\\"token comment\\">// [1, 2, 3]</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>这道题有点类似于Promise.all()，不过.all()不需要管执行顺序，只需要并发执行就行了。但是这里需要等上一个执行完毕之后才能执行下一个。</p>\\n<p><strong>解题思路：</strong></p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>定义一个数组data用于保存所有异步操作的结果</li>\\n<li>用 <code>let promise = Promise.resolve()</code> 初始化链，再把每次新增阶段返回的期约重新赋给 <code>promise</code></li>\\n</ul>\\n<p>答案：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">mergePromise</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">ajaxArray</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 存放每个ajax的结果</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> data <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> promise <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  ajaxArray<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">forEach</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">ajax</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  \\t<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 第一次的then为了用来调用ajax</span>\\n  \\t<span class=\\"token comment\\">// 第二次的then是为了获取ajax的结果</span>\\n    promise <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>ajax<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      data<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> data<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 把每次的结果返回</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 空任务列表也返回空数组；非空列表等整条链完成</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> data<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>传入三个已经创建的请求期约，还能保证串行发送吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不能，请求可能早已启动。需要传入创建请求的函数，由调度器决定何时调用。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>第二项失败，第三项还需要执行，怎么改？</strong></p>\\n<p>在每项内部捕获并保存成败结果，然后继续循环。不要只在整条链末尾恢复，否则被跳过的任务不会自动补跑。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>空数组为什么不能直接返回初始 <code>Promise.resolve()</code>？</strong></p>\\n<p>它的成功值是 <code>undefined</code>，不符合返回结果数组的约定。最后统一返回 <code>results</code>，空输入自然是 <code>[]</code>。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>串行任务有几百个，是否一定要改成并发？</strong></p>\\n<p>先看任务是否存在数据依赖或顺序约束。独立任务可以改成有限并发，有严格先后关系的任务仍应保持串行。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_8-4-封装一个异步加载图片的方法\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_8-4-封装一个异步加载图片的方法\\">#</a> 8.4 封装一个异步加载图片的方法</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>创建 <code>Image</code>，先绑定事件再设置 <code>src</code></li>\\n<li><code>onload</code> 成功交付图片，<code>onerror</code> 拒绝</li>\\n<li>超时与取消也要完成等待并清理监听</li>\\n<li>需要像素读取时，提前配置跨域并要求服务端配合</li>\\n<li>图片加载完成不等于已经在屏幕上绘制</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>图片加载可以封装成一个成功返回图片对象、失败返回拒绝的期约。</strong> 创建 <code>Image</code> 后先设置成功和失败处理，再赋值 <code>src</code> 开始加载，避免遗漏完成事件。工程实现还要把超时、取消与正常完成统一管理，结束时清理监听和定时器。若图片要画到画布并读取像素，必须额外考虑跨域权限，能显示图片不代表可以读取它的内容。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>这个相对简单一些，只需要在图片的onload函数中，使用resolve返回一下就可以了。\\n来看看具体代码：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">loadImg</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">url</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> img <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Image</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    img<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">onload</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"一张图片加载完成\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>img<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    img<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">onerror</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    \\t<span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'Could not load image at\'</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> url<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    img<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>src <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> url<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>上面是最小实现。生产中还要把超时和取消纳入同一个完成出口，并在完成后清理 <code>onload</code>、<code>onerror</code>、定时器和 <code>abort</code> 监听。<code>Promise</code> 状态只能确定一次，并不代表其他引用会自动清理。</p>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>只写成功回调，不写失败回调，图片坏了会怎样？</strong></p>\\n<p>包装的期约可能一直待定，调用方的加载状态也无法结束。必须在 <code>onerror</code> 中拒绝。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>跨域图片能显示，为什么画布读取像素却报错？</strong></p>\\n<p>显示与读取像素的权限不同。设置合适的 <code>crossOrigin</code> 并让服务端返回允许的跨域响应，才能保持画布可读取。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>取消等待只调用一次 <code>reject</code> 就够了吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不够，还要清理事件、定时器和取消监听。是否真正停止下载取决于底层机制，期约拒绝本身不会自动释放所有资源。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>要减少插入大图时的解码卡顿，可以等什么？</strong></p>\\n<p>可以结合图片的 <code>decode()</code> 等待解码完成，并处理它的拒绝。它仍不承诺图片已经完成屏幕绘制。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n<h3 id=\\"_8-5-限制异步操作的并发个数并尽可能快的完成全部\\"><a class=\\"header-anchor\\" href=\\"#_8-5-限制异步操作的并发个数并尽可能快的完成全部\\">#</a> 8.5 限制异步操作的并发个数并尽可能快的完成全部</h3>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block recall\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title recall-title\\">⚡ 30 秒速记</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>最多启动 <code>limit</code> 个工作循环</li>\\n<li>谁完成谁领取下一项，避免整批等最慢任务</li>\\n<li>领取索引后执行，结果写回原位置</li>\\n<li>同步抛错、拒绝、空数组与非法上限都要处理</li>\\n<li>整体失败不会自动停止其他工作循环</li>\\n</ul>\\n<p><strong>并发限制最好用固定数量的工作循环，空出一个位置就马上补下一项。</strong> 每个循环领取一个索引，等待该任务完成后再领取下一个，这样活跃任务数不会超过上限，也不用等整批里最慢的请求。结果写入输入对应的位置，完成顺序就不会打乱返回数组。还要定义失败策略：整体首错拒绝时，其他循环默认仍会继续，需要停止就增加共享标记或取消信号。</p>\\n</section>\\n<p>有8个图片资源的url，已经存储在数组urls中。</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>urls类似于[\'<a href=\\"https://image1.png\\">https://image1.png</a>\', \'<a href=\\"https://image2.png\\">https://image2.png</a>\', ....]</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p>而且已经有一个函数function loadImg，输入一个url链接，返回一个Promise，该Promise在图片下载完成的时候resolve，下载失败则reject。</p>\\n<p>但有一个要求，任何时刻同时下载的链接数量不可以超过3个。</p>\\n<p>请写一段代码实现这个需求，要求尽可能快速地将所有图片下载完成。</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">var</span> urls <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token string\\">\\"https://hexo-blog-1256114407.cos.ap-shenzhen-fsi.myqcloud.com/AboutMe-painting1.png\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token string\\">\\"https://hexo-blog-1256114407.cos.ap-shenzhen-fsi.myqcloud.com/AboutMe-painting2.png\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token string\\">\\"https://hexo-blog-1256114407.cos.ap-shenzhen-fsi.myqcloud.com/AboutMe-painting3.png\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token string\\">\\"https://hexo-blog-1256114407.cos.ap-shenzhen-fsi.myqcloud.com/AboutMe-painting4.png\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token string\\">\\"https://hexo-blog-1256114407.cos.ap-shenzhen-fsi.myqcloud.com/AboutMe-painting5.png\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token string\\">\\"https://hexo-blog-1256114407.cos.ap-shenzhen-fsi.myqcloud.com/bpmn6.png\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token string\\">\\"https://hexo-blog-1256114407.cos.ap-shenzhen-fsi.myqcloud.com/bpmn7.png\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token string\\">\\"https://hexo-blog-1256114407.cos.ap-shenzhen-fsi.myqcloud.com/bpmn8.png\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">loadImg</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">url</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Promise</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">resolve<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> img <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Image</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    img<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">onload</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\\"一张图片加载完成\\"</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>img<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    img<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">onerror</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    \\t<span class=\\"token function\\">reject</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Error</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'Could not load image at\'</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> url<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    img<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>src <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> url<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>看到这道题时，我最开始的想法是：</p>\\n<p>拿到urls，然后将这个数组每3个<code>url</code>一组创建成一个二维数组\\n然后用<code>Promise.all()</code>每次加载一组url（也就是并发3个），这一组加载完再加载下一组。</p>\\n<blockquote>\\n<p>这个想法从技术上说并不难实现，有点类似于第三题。不过缺点也明显，那就是每次都要等到上一组全部加载完之后，才加载下一组，那如果上一组有2个已经加载完了，还有1个特别慢，还在加载，要等这个慢的也加载完才能进入下一组。这明显会照常卡顿，影响加载效率\\n`</p>\\n</blockquote>\\n<p>想法一💡：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">limitLoad</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">urls<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> handler<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> limit</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> data <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 存储所有的加载结果</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">handleUrls</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">urls</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 这个函数是为了生成3个url为一组的二维数组</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> doubleDim <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> len <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">ceil</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>urls<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length <span class=\\"token operator\\">/</span> limit<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// Math.ceil(8 / 3) = 3</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>len<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 3, 表示二维数组的长度为3</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">for</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> len<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> i<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      doubleDim<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>urls<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">slice</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>i <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> limit<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>i <span class=\\"token operator\\">+</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">*</span> limit<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> doubleDim<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> <span class=\\"token function-variable function\\">ajaxImage</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">urlCollect</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 将一组字符串url 转换为一个加载图片的数组</span>\\n    console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>urlCollect<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> urlCollect<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">map</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">url</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">handler</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>url<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> doubleDim <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">handleUrls</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>urls<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 得到3个url为一组的二维数组</span>\\n  doubleDim<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">forEach</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">urlCollect</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    p <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> p<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">all</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token function\\">ajaxImage</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>urlCollect<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      data<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">push</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">...</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 将每次的结果展开，并存储到data中 (res为：[img, img, img])</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> data<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> p<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n<span class=\\"token function\\">limitLoad</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>urls<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> loadImg<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">res</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  console<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">log</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span> <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 最终得到的是长度为8的img数组: [img, img, img, ...]</span>\\n  res<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">forEach</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">img</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    document<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>body<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">appendChild</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>img<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">;</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>上面是易于理解的分批方案，它能保证并发数不超标，却不符合“尽可能快”。更合适的实现是让固定数量的 <code>worker</code> 动态领取任务：</p>\\n<pre class=\\"language-js\\"><code><span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">mapLimit</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token parameter\\">items<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> limit<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> task</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">!</span>Number<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">isInteger</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>limit<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">||</span> limit <span class=\\"token operator\\">&lt;</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">1</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">throw</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">RangeError</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token string\\">\'limit 必须是正整数\'</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> results <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">new</span> <span class=\\"token class-name\\">Array</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>items<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">let</span> cursor <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">0</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">async</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">function</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">worker</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token keyword\\">while</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token boolean\\">true</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> index <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> cursor<span class=\\"token operator\\">++</span>\\n      <span class=\\"token keyword\\">if</span> <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>index <span class=\\"token operator\\">>=</span> items<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span>\\n\\n      <span class=\\"token comment\\">// 同时把 task 的同步抛错转成 Promise 拒绝</span>\\n      results<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">resolve</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">then</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span> <span class=\\"token operator\\">=></span> <span class=\\"token function\\">task</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>items<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">[</span>index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">]</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> index<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n    <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> workerCount <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> Math<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">min</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>limit<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> items<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span>length<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> Promise<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">all</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>Array<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">.</span><span class=\\"token function\\">from</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">{</span> <span class=\\"token literal-property property\\">length</span><span class=\\"token operator\\">:</span> workerCount <span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> worker<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n  <span class=\\"token keyword\\">return</span> results\\n<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">}</span>\\n\\n<span class=\\"token keyword\\">const</span> images <span class=\\"token operator\\">=</span> <span class=\\"token keyword\\">await</span> <span class=\\"token function\\">mapLimit</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">(</span>urls<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> <span class=\\"token number\\">3</span><span class=\\"token punctuation\\">,</span> loadImg<span class=\\"token punctuation\\">)</span>\\n</code></pre>\\n<p>每个 <code>worker</code> 只有在上一个 <code>await</code> 完成后才会领取新索引，因此正在执行的任务不会超过 <code>limit</code>。结果写入原索引，所以即使完成顺序不同，返回数组仍与输入对齐。时间复杂度是 <code>O(n)</code>，结果空间是 <code>O(n)</code>，调度器中活跃的执行单元为 <code>O(limit)</code>。</p>\\n<p>这份代码采用首错拒绝语义，但 <code>Promise.all</code> 不会自动取消已启动任务。如果首错后必须停止其他请求，需要向 <code>task</code> 传入共享的 <code>AbortSignal</code>。如果要等全部完成再收集成败，则在 <code>worker</code> 内捕获错误，像 <code>Promise.allSettled()</code> 一样保存 <code>{ status, value, reason }</code>。</p>\\n<section class=\\"custom-block followup\\"><p class=\\"custom-block-title followup-title\\">💬 面试官追问</p>\\n<ul>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>三个任务里两个已经完成，分批方案为什么慢？</strong></p>\\n<p>它要等第三个也完成才启动下一批，空出来的位置被浪费。动态领取能立即补入后续任务。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>结果直接 <code>push</code>，返回顺序会稳定吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会，多个任务完成先后不同。用 <code>results[index] = value</code> 按输入索引存储。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong><code>Promise.all(workers)</code> 拒绝后，其他循环会停止领任务吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>不会自动停止，它们仍会执行自己的循环。首错后要停止派发，就检查共享停止状态，并按能力取消正在进行的操作。</p>\\n</li>\\n<li>\\n<p><strong>任务函数还没返回期约就同步抛错，会漏掉吗？</strong></p>\\n<p>放在异步工作循环的捕获范围内，或通过期约回调调用它，就能统一转成拒绝。别在建立错误处理之前提前执行所有任务。</p>\\n</li>\\n</ul>\\n</section>\\n"}')}}]);